ng through the Western Wyld, he meets many warped, illogical creatures, and faces many perils of the ocean and the heart. Yet, by the will of Mercury, he perseveres.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/476-argonometra","name":"Argonometra","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"534"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-05-08T00:28:56-07:00","id":128054,"title":"","content":"[QUOTE=Sunder the Gold;n127908]<br /> Kannazuki no Miko (Priestesses of the Godless Month).<br /> [/QUOTE<br /> <br /> Nope, this one's still standing but ...<br /> <br /> <br /> <div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Sunder the Gold</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/11921-the-great-marriage-of-exalted-and-insert-fandom-here?p=127908#post127908\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Madoka Rebellion? Haven't heard much about it.<br /> <br /> <br /> <br /> MaiHiME.<br /> <br /> <br /> <br /> MaiOtome.</div> </div> </div> </div>The first one is Puella Magi Madoka Magica, but I'm not going to split hairs. The other two are spot on!<br /> <br /> Back to the bookshelf for me ...<br />","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1849-suddenthunder","name":"SuddenThunder","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1849_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"563"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-05-08T03:14:15-07:00","id":128115,"title":"","content":"<u>Banditry!</u><br /> <br /> Three orphans become Lunar Exalted and grow up to be the most skilled and accomplished thieves and burglars in the world, so much so that they give up 'regular' crime and start collecting matching sets of rare items such as pages from a broken grimoire, pieces of a malignant Alchemical, companions for a mega-heist and ancestors from throughout time(!). Throughout all this they are pursued by a feisty Solar magistrate indulging in an on-again-off-again flirtation with her (maybe) Lunar mate.<br /> <br /> <u>The Mourning Kingdom</u><br /> <br /> As the Ebon Dragon breaks free of his bonds a night caste Solar protects a Lunar sorceress in her mission to refresh the seals and save the world. On the way they battle four debased Infernals and the Lunar's steadily-more-insane father. In the end, after the dust settles it turns out that you can't trust a thief to put the needs of others before themselves.<br /> <br /> <u>Lachryma</u><br /> <br /> A rootin', tootin' bad-guy-shootin' Abyssal is recruited by his Solar twin in a battle against powerful demons. After defeating a succubus, a news anchor and an unborn monstrosity, having waded through a sea of black blood with both style and panache, the pair fight the final battle together and overcome the demon king. Then the Great Curse ruins everything ...","signature":"","edited":{"userid":1849,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1849-suddenthunder","user":"SuddenThunder","date":".  Somehow managed to leave out half of 'Lachryma' 05-08-2014, 06:15 AM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1849-suddenthunder","name":"SuddenThunder","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1849_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"563"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-05-08T04:53:09-07:00","id":128151,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>SuddenThunder</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/11921-the-great-marriage-of-exalted-and-insert-fandom-here?p=128115#post128115\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><u>Banditry!</u><br /> <br /> Three orphans become Lunar Exalted and grow up to be the most skilled and accomplished thieves and burglars in the world, so much so that they give up 'regular' crime and start collecting matching sets of rare items such as pages from a broken grimoire, pieces of a malignant Alchemical, companions for a mega-heist and ancestors from throughout time(!). Throughout all this they are pursued by a feisty Solar magistrate indulging in an on-again-off-again flirtation with her (maybe) Lunar mate.</div> </div> </div> </div>Cat's eye, I guess.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/73-ares","name":"Ares","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar73_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"133"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-05-08T05:07:24-07:00","id":128156,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Ares</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/11921-the-great-marriage-of-exalted-and-insert-fandom-here?p=128151#post128151\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> Cat's eye, I guess.</div> </div> </div> </div>Nope, afraid not.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1849-suddenthunder","name":"SuddenThunder","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1849_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"563"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-05-08T06:44:12-07:00","id":128195,"title":"","content":"<span style=\"font-size:12px\"><span style=\"font-family:arial\">For most mortals, she only brought out the regular scissors. They were nice scissors, to be sure, cold iron with handles of obsidian, but they were only special in so far as the entity that wielded them. This, however, was no mere mortal, but a Prince Of Earth. Saturn brought the jade scissors.<br /> <br /> Envanel Tepet's hun soul glowered down at his body, sorely disappointed in its performance.<br /> <br /> &quot;It was my ankle,&quot; He told her.<br /> <br /> <span style=\"color:#800080\"><b><span style=\"font-size:10px\"><span style=\"font-family:georgia\">I'M SURE IT WAS.</span></span></b></span><br /> <br /> Envanel looked curiously as the Maiden Of Ending reached into him. Normally, he'd be frightened but at this point the worst had passed, as far as he was concerned. Honestly, this was more fascinating than anything else. Envanel was no sorcerer, but he had to admire how Saturn reached into all three of him, his body and both his souls, with just one grab and one hand and pulled out one thread. A thread that somehow came from all three of them but just one place at the same time. It was a bit geometrical nonsense that normally only sorcerers, demons or fae got to see.<br /> <br /> He still felt, however, the need to defend him, &quot;I twisted my ankle, see? Jumping to the defense of my elders, of course.&quot; He twisted trying to outrun his elders, actually. He glared over at the shining glowing gold beacon of the Lawgiver, hastily retreating from his corpse.<br /> <br /> &quot;If my ankle hadn't been in bad shape, I would've gotten him.&quot;<br /> <br /> His po soul growled in agreement.<br /> <br /> <span style=\"color:#800080\"><b><span style=\"font-size:10px\"><span style=\"font-family:georgia\">I'M CERTAIN YOU WOULD HAVE.</span></span></b></span> That was a lie. The Night Caste had set everything up perfectly for that ambush. Envanel had only had time to turn around because the Solar had wanted to see the light go out of his eyes. However, there was no point in breaking the poor dear's illusions.<br /> <br /> &quot;I'll get him eventually,&quot; Envanel said with certainty.<br /> <br /> <b><span style=\"color:#800080\"><span style=\"font-size:10px\"><span style=\"font-family:georgia\">YOU'RE NOT THINKING OF BECOMING A GHOST, ARE YOU?</span></span></span></b><br /> <br /> &quot;What? No, don't be silly! I'll get him next time,&quot; He twirled his finger in demonstration, &quot;You know, next time around.&quot;<br /> <br /> <span style=\"font-family:georgia\"><span style=\"font-size:10px\"><b><span style=\"color:#800080\">SPEAKING OF WHICH.</span></b></span></span> Saturn took the jade scissors to the Fate of his life and cut it cleanly.<br /> <br /> <b><span style=\"color:#800080\"><span style=\"font-size:10px\"><span style=\"font-family:georgia\">GOOD BYE, ENVANEL TEPET.</span></span></span></b><br /> <br /> &quot;Next time,&quot; Envanel muttered confidently as his hun soul slowly faded, &quot;Maybe I'll be an Air Aspect next time. That way I'll-&quot; The rest of his words were snatched away by the silent roar of Lethe.<br /> <br /> Saturn made her sign and left. There was more work to be done.<br /> <br /> There was no end to endings.</span></span>","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1252-god_of_awesome","name":"God_of_Awesome","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1252_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"570"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-05-08T07:12:24-07:00","id":128211,"title":"","content":"I can't tie it to a particular scene, but it sure feels like the numerous scenes from Discworld involving Death.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/582-morangias","name":"Morangias","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar582_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1670"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-05-08T09:47:53-07:00","id":128324,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>SuddenThunder</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/11921-the-great-marriage-of-exalted-and-insert-fandom-here?p=128115#post128115\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><u>The Mourning Kingdom</u><br /> <br /> As the Ebon Dragon breaks free of his bonds a night caste Solar protects a Lunar sorceress in her mission to refresh the seals and save the world. On the way they battle four debased Infernals and the Lunar's steadily-more-insane father. In the end, after the dust settles it turns out that you can't trust a thief to put the needs of others before themselves.</div> </div> </div> </div><i>Prince of Persia</i> (the most recent one)<br /> <br /> <div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <u>Lachryma</u><br /> <br /> A rootin', tootin' bad-guy-shootin' Abyssal is recruited by his Solar twin in a battle against powerful demons. After defeating a succubus, a news anchor and an unborn monstrosity, having waded through a sea of black blood with both style and panache, the pair fight the final battle together and overcome the demon king. Then the Great Curse ruins everything ... </div> </div> </div>Perhaps... <i>Double Dragon</i>?","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1369-mewtarthio","name":"Mewtarthio","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"182"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-05-08T09:53:47-07:00","id":128330,"title":"","content":"*smacks forehead* I mean <i>DMC 3</i>. What with the guns and demons. That would make more sense.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1369-mewtarthio","name":"Mewtarthio","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"182"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-05-08T11:26:06-07:00","id":128391,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></