"rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"563"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-05-08T15:43:45-07:00","id":128574,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>SuddenThunder</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/11921-the-great-marriage-of-exalted-and-insert-fandom-here?p=128054#post128054\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Sunder the Gold</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/11921-the-great-marriage-of-exalted-and-insert-fandom-here?p=127908#post127908\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Kannazuki no Miko (Priestesses of the Godless Month).</div> </div> </div> </div>Nope, this one's still standing</div> </div> </div> </div>Yeah, I totally misread that one the second time. The first time I read it I properly had no clue, but the second time I only read the second half of it and jumped to a wrong conclusion... possibly because of all the other &quot;girls love&quot; magical girl stories following it.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>formerly Tornado Wolf, formerly Inugami","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/636-sunder-the-gold","name":"Sunder the Gold","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar636_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"5515"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-05-08T20:55:36-07:00","id":128715,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>SuddenThunder</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/11921-the-great-marriage-of-exalted-and-insert-fandom-here?p=128115#post128115\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><u>Banditry!</u><br /> <br /> Three orphans become Lunar Exalted and grow up to be the most skilled and accomplished thieves and burglars in the world, so much so that they give up 'regular' crime and start collecting matching sets of rare items such as pages from a broken grimoire, pieces of a malignant Alchemical, companions for a mega-heist and ancestors from throughout time(!). Throughout all this they are pursued by a feisty Solar magistrate indulging in an on-again-off-again flirtation with her (maybe) Lunar mate.<br /></div> </div> </div> </div>Sly Cooper?","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/23-saur-ops-specialist","name":"Saur Ops Specialist","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar23_3.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"9371"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-05-09T05:27:54-07:00","id":128881,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Saur Ops Specialist</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/11921-the-great-marriage-of-exalted-and-insert-fandom-here?p=128715#post128715\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> Sly Cooper?</div> </div> </div> </div>It is! I'm so hoping there's another one ...","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1849-suddenthunder","name":"SuddenThunder","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1849_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"563"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-05-09T07:38:16-07:00","id":128942,"title":"","content":"You know, it occurs to me I haven't actually <i>suggested</i> one of since the new forums came up. Shame on me.<br /> <br /> Playing fast, loose, and with the caveat that I haven't touched any of these in years.<br /> <br /> ****************<br /> <br /> A disillusioned Immaculate Monk is imbued with the power of the Zenith Caste, and travels the length and breadth of the Realm trying to discover what it is he's become. While he has allies--his Lunar mate is a deadly archer, and he's attracted the company of a jovial-but-wicked day caste--he's picked up enemies, too. Along the way, his devil-may-care attitude garners the wrath of authorities mortal, divine, and--in the case of a sidereal scorned deeply by fate--in between. Before long, he even has a relentless, terrifying, and brutal Dusk caste on his heels.<br /> <br /> The deck's stacked against him, but he's got a mission: to confront the Unconquered Sun himself and take him to task for turning his face from his Chosen, and letting Creation fall as far as it has.<br /> <br /> ****************<br /> <br /> A glitch in fate draws a young Terrestrial to the East, where she is blessed to be the herald of Sextes Jylis himself. Accompanied by seven champions imbued with the dragon's souls, she seeks to defend her adopted land from Realm incursion, where a similar hiccup in the workings of the world have left her closest friend as the herald of Pasiap. But there is a greater price to pay than mere loss of a friend. For when she brings the dragon of Wood into the world, it may bring her her heart's desires, but it may well consume her in the process. And even though she has fallen in love with one of her champions, his existence is finite--even if she succeeds and survives, he cannot remain incarnate for long.<br /> <br /> ****************<br /> <br /> A young man discovers a daiklave and takes it, drawing the second breath as one of the Dawn Caste. Now, with a runaway Dynast and a mischievous Lunar, he must travel across Creation to protect a series of war manses. Along the way, he encounters mountain folk, benign raksha, the powerful elemental guardians of the manses, and a small team of entrepreneurial scavenger lords. Some will help. Some will most definitely not. But if the boy and his friends fail, the powers of Malfeas will have their hands on the Sword of Creation. And they discover all-too-late that the Dynast's lover--an officer in the Imperial Legions--has a dark destiny upon him. They do fail, and the world cowers.<br /> <br /> Perhaps more terrifying is Heaven's response: Unleash the Kukla.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":561,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/561-mockery","user":"Mockery","date":". 05-09-2014, 11:46 AM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/561-mockery","name":"Mockery","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar561_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"876"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-05-09T07:54:49-07:00","id":128951,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Mockery</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/11921-the-great-marriage-of-exalted-and-insert-fandom-here?p=128942#post128942\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">You know, it occurs to me I haven't actually <i>suggested</i> one of since the new forums came up. Shame on me.<br /> <br /> Playing fast, loose, and with the caveat that I haven't touched any of these in years.<br /> <br /> ****************<br /> <br /> A disillusioned Immaculate Monk is imbued with the power of the Zenith Caste, and travels the length and breadth of the Realm trying to discover what it is he's become. While he has allies--his Lunar mate is a deadly archer, and he's attracted the company of a jovial-but-wicked day caste--he's picked up enemies, too. Along the way, his devil-may-care attitude garners the wrath of authorities mortal, divine, and--in the case of a sidereal scorned deeply by fate--in between. Before long, he even has a relentless, terrifying, and brutal Dusk caste on his heels.<br /> <br /> The deck's stacked against him, but he's got a mission: to confront the Unconquered Sun himself and take him to task for turning his face from his Chosen, and letting Creation fall as far as it has.<br /> <br /> ****************<br /> <br /> A glitch in fate draws a young Terrestrial to the South, where she is blessed to be the herald of Hesiesh himself. Accompanied by seven champions imbued with the dragon's souls, she seeks to defend her adopted land from Realm incursion, where a similar hiccup in the workings of the world have left her closest friend as the herald of Pasiap. But there is a greater price to pay than mere loss of a friend. For when she brings the dragon of Fire into the world, it may bring her her heart's desires, but it may well consume her in the process. And even though she has fallen in love with one of her champions, his existence is finite--even if she succeeds and survives, he cannot remain incarnate for long.<br /> <br /> ****************<br /> <br /> A young man discovers a daiklave and takes it, drawing the second breath as one of the Dawn Caste. Now, with a runaway Dynast and a mischievous Lunar, he must travel across Creation to protect a series of war manses. Along the way, he encounters mountain folk, benign raksha, the powerful elemental guardians of the manses, and a small team of entrepreneurial scavenger lords. Some will help. Some will most definitely not. But if the boy and his friends fail, the powers of Malfeas will have their hands on the Sword of Creation. And they discover all-too-late that the Dynast's lover--an officer in the Imperial Legions--has a dark destiny upon him. They do fail, and the world cowers.<br /> <br /> Perhaps more terrifying is Heaven's response: Unleash the Kukla.</div> </div> </div> </div>The first is Preacher. The second... I'm guessing X/1999, but I'm not sure. The third... Clash of the Titans, I think? The line is certainly a reference, but I've never seen it, so I can't be sure.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1407-endlesskng","name":"EndlessKng","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"335"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-05-09T07:58:14-07:00","id":128956,"title":"","content":"Right on the first, but the other two are off. I had to take some liberties with #2...in fact, you know what, I'm going to make one small edit right now, just to embrace aesthetic and setting over certain source material details, instead of doing it half-heartedly.<br /> <br /> as for #3...it's not really &quot;Unleash the Kraken&quot; in this case. It's just permeated memetically enough that it was the easiest way to phrase it.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/561-mockery","name":"Mockery","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar561_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"876"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-05-09T08:36:56-07:00","id":128984,"title":"","content":"Second is Fushigi Yuugi, and the third is Secret of Mana.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>formerly Tornado Wolf, formerly Inugami","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":2}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/636-sunder-the-gold","name":"Sunder the Gold","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar636_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"5515"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-05-09T08:47:18-07:00","id":128993,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Sunder the Gold</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/11921-the-great-marriage-of-exalted-and-insert-fandom-here?p=128984#post128984\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Second is Fushigi Yuugi, and the third is Secret of Mana.</div> </div> </div> </div>Got it. Alas, my 90's-kid-self is showing.<br /> <br />","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/561-mockery","name":"Mockery","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar561_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"876"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-05-09T08:47:19-07:00","id":128994,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Mockery</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/11921-the-great-marriage-of-exalted-and-insert-fandom-here?p=128942#post128942\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">A glitch in fate draws a young Terrestrial to the East, where she is blessed to be the herald of Sextes Jylis himself. Accompanied by seven champions imbued with the dragon's souls, she seeks to defend her adopted land from Realm incursion, where a similar hiccup in the workings of the world have left her closest friend as the herald of Pasiap. But there is a greater price to pay than mere loss of a friend. For when she brings the dragon of Fire into the world, it may bring her her heart's desires, but it may well consume her in the process. And even though she has fallen in love with one of her champions, his existence is finite--even if she succeeds and survives, he cannot remain incarnate for long.</div> </div> </div> </div>Probably off, but a lot of that sounds like Final Fantasy X.<br />","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1849-suddenthunder","name":"SuddenThunder","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1849_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"563"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-05-09T10:16:33-07:00","id":129065,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>SuddenThunder</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/11921-the-great-marriage-of-exalted-and-insert-fandom-here?p=128994#post128994\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> Probably off, but a lot of that sounds like Final Fantasy X.</div> </div> </div> </div>Yeah, Sunder got it with Fushigi Yuugi. Though in retrospect I can see the parallels.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/561-mockery","name":"Mockery","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar561_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"876"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-05-12T09:17:29-07:00","id":133838,"title":"","content":"I hope this one isn't either too obscure or too obvious...<br /> <br /> A dynastic wedding almost done with it's preparations when a strangely dressed traveling apothecary slips appears uninvi