er","date":".  Adding a new marriage. 05-16-2014, 10:22 PM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2598-gryphon-s-feather","name":"Gryphon's Feather","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar2598_3.png","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Mar 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"215"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-05-16T23:52:45-07:00","id":140302,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Gryphon's Feather</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/11921-the-great-marriage-of-exalted-and-insert-fandom-here?p=140084#post140084\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Edit: This should be easier than my other one.<br /> <br /> A young mortal's house is set ablaze by a yozi cult, his family is murdered, he's enslaved, and nearly sacrificed before he exalts as a fiend caste infernal, instantly summoning a second circle demon to aid him in all tasks until he can avenge his parents, but then, he must pay the price for the demon's services...<br /> <br /> After killing the cultists, he returns home and builds a good reputation for himself and his house in only three years.<br /> <br /> Soon, he is called to investigate a series of gruesome murders by an abyssal in red...</div> </div> </div> </div>Black Butler/Kuroshitsuji.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/51-marin","name":"marin","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2019"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-05-17T16:05:25-07:00","id":140999,"title":"","content":"Correct, I went for the obvious anime/manga this time. I don't think anyone's going to get the other one.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><b>Currently Playing:</b> <i>A large, mixed splat game of <b>CofD</b>.</i> <b>As:</b> Seraph du Salomon, Voice on the concordance. Unsubtle man reluctantly participating in the business of Magi. Awakening 2E homebrew <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/mage-the-awakening/1338514-house-du-salomon-a-proximus-dynasty?_=1569864567692\" target=\"_blank\">http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/m...=1569864567692</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2598-gryphon-s-feather","name":"Gryphon's Feather","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar2598_3.png","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Mar 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"215"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-05-19T04:11:09-07:00","id":142222,"title":"","content":"<br /> <div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Gryphon's Feather</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/11921-the-great-marriage-of-exalted-and-insert-fandom-here?p=140084#post140084\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">XXX-Holic?</div> </div> </div> </div>Yep. Here's another.<br /> <br /> A young Fire Aspect's attempted vacation is delayed when a Twilight, wood spirit, and feline beastman summon him, asking for help. An Infernal sorcerer has conquered their world, and only a Dragon-Blooded can stop him. (Because fuck power tiers.)","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/476-argonometra","name":"Argonometra","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"534"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-05-20T06:44:18-07:00","id":143374,"title":"","content":"This here's a &quot;Marriage&quot; coming from the other way.<br /> <br /> I had an idea for a Fairy Tail verse Wizard who practices &quot;Shintai Magic&quot;, by combining Requip magic to gather the proper item foci, Celestial magic to contact the demonic beings the items connect to and Beast Take Over to change your form to match them.<br /> <br /> *wearing a brass crown*<br /> <br /> &quot;Open! The Gate Of The Demon Emperor! Malfeas!&quot;<br /> <br /> *Demon Emperor Shintai*","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1252-god_of_awesome","name":"God_of_Awesome","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1252_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"570"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-05-23T15:42:19-07:00","id":147233,"title":"","content":"<b>Team YOZI</b><br /> <span style=\"color:#000000\"><span style=\"font-family:sans-serif\">A group of particularly violent faunus, bounded together by a shared sense of loss and a hatred for the upstart humanity. Truthfully, they've all been mentally shattered, and are used as weapons of terror by the White Fang.</span></span><br /> <span style=\"color:#2C5500\"><span style=\"font-family:sans-serif\">Maleficent Yridian</span></span><br /> <span style=\"color:#000000\"><span style=\"font-family:sans-serif\">Race: Hawk </span></span><br /> <span style=\"color:#000000\"><span style=\"font-family:sans-serif\">Weapon: </span></span><i>Brass Dancer</i><span style=\"color:#000000\"><span style=\"font-family:sans-serif\">, full body power armor with wrist mounted flame throwers, rocket elbow, rocket feet and a jetpack. </span></span><br /> <span style=\"color:#000000\"><span style=\"font-family:sans-serif\">Semblance: </span></span><i>Green Sun</i><span style=\"color:#000000\"><span style=\"font-family:sans-serif\">, </span></span><a href=\"http://tvtropes.org/pmwiki/pmwiki.php/Main/PlayingWithFire\" target=\"_blank\">pyrokinesis</a><span style=\"color:#000000\"><span style=\"font-family:sans-serif\">. Every flame she controls turns green. </span></span><br /> <span style=\"color:#000000\"><span style=\"font-family:sans-serif\">Appearance: Two ugly scars mar her shoulders, her eyes are glowing neon green, tanned, her hair is short and green. </span></span><br /> <span style=\"color:#000000\"><span style=\"font-family:sans-serif\">History: She lived in a place where human-faunus violence was still high and brutal, and frontier justice was the only justice. Once, her family ruled quite a lot of land, herself the newly appointed head of the house, but in retaliation to one ancient slight she lost her home, her fortune, her husband and daughter, and her wings. Now she is quite mad. Angry and insane.</span></span><br /> <span style=\"color:#626262\"><span style=\"font-family:sans-serif\">Oriana Argent</span></span><br /> <span style=\"color:#000000\"><span style=\"font-family:sans-serif\">Race: Cat </span></span><br /> <span style=\"color:#000000\"><span style=\"font-family:sans-serif\">Weapon: </span></span><i>Kagami</i><span style=\"color:#000000\"><span style=\"font-family:sans-serif\">, a very odd machine, a technological marvel, reflecting the shattered genius of its wielder. It is capable of being every weapon possible, but it has no means to become any on its own. It needs another nearby weapon to imitate, clicking and rearranging all the right shiny silver pieces into place. </span></span><br /> <span style=\"color:#000000\"><span style=\"font-family:sans-serif\">Semblance: </span></span><i>Silver Forest</i><span style=\"color:#000000\"><span style=\"font-family:sans-serif\">, </span></span><a href=\"http://tvtropes.org/pmwiki/pmwiki.php/Main/PowerCopier\" target=\"_blank\">copies other's Semblances</a><span style=\"color:#000000\"><span style=\"font-family:sans-serif\">, with a silver sheen! </span></span><br /> <span style=\"color:#000000\"><span style=\"font-family:sans-serif\">Appearance: Long glossy silver hair, silver eyes, silver ears, pale skin. </span></span><br /> <span style=\"color:#000000\"><span style=\"font-family:sans-serif\">History: Once a child in the poor ghettos far outside proper civilzation, all she ever had was a mirror and a lot of imagination. She preen herself, imagining herself as someone else, follow along behind other people, pretending to be them, and looking at different machines, postulating how one might make them into one super machine. Then bad men came, rounding up faunus and tossing them into prisons. She was thrown into a dark hole where she cracked her mirror, and her head. When the White Fang liberated them, she came out of the dark changed.</span></span><br /> <span style=\"color:#C80815\"><span style=\"font-family:sans-serif\">Sanguin Zephyr</span></span><br /> <span style=\"color:#000000\"><span style=\"font-family:sans-serif\">Race: Wolf </span></span><br /> <span style=\"color:#000000\"><span style=\"font-family:sans-serif\">Weapon: </span></span><i>Crimson Scourge</i><span style=\"color:#000000\"><span style=\"font-family:sans-serif\">, a chainsaw that transforms into a chaingun, wrapped around him by a chain. </span></span><br /> <span style=\"color:#000000\"><span style=\"font-family:sans-serif\">Semblance: </span></span><i><a href=\"http://tvtropes.org/pmwiki/pmwiki.php/Main/SuperSpeed\" target=\"_blank\">Silent Wind</a></i><br /> <span style=\"color:#000000\"><span style=\"font-family:sans-serif\">Appearance: Long red hair the billows in the wind, red eyes, red ears, tail, the works. Lightly tanned skin. </span></span><br /> <span style=\"color:#000000\"><span style=\"font-family:sans-serif\">History: Some very bad men killed his sister, his only family, in some very bad ways, right in front of him too and everything. They were about to do the same to him as well, but he managed to loosen his bonds and un away. He ran away and never looked back, leaving it all behind, love, empathy, restraint.</span></span><br /> <span style=\"color:#C80815\"><span style=\"font-family:sans-serif\"><b>Isabelle Coal </b></span></span><br /> <span style=\"color:#000000\"><span style=\"font-family:sans-serif\">Race: Boar </span></span><br /> <span style=\"color:#000000\"><span style=\"font-family:sans-serif\">Weapon: </span></span><i>Sky Twister</i><span style=\"color:#000000\"><span style=\"font-family:sans-serif\">, a pair of gauntlets that absorb kinetic energy, releasing their stores at her command to terrible force. </span></span><br /> <span style=\"color:#000000\"><span style=\"font-family:sans-serif\">Semblance: </span></span><i>Nomad Force</i><span style=\"color:#000000\"><span style=\"font-family:sans-serif\">, </span></span><a href=\"http://tvtropes.org/pmwiki/pmwiki.php/Main/SuperStrength\" target=\"_blank\">Super Strength</a><span style=\"color:#000000\"><span style=\"font-family:sans-serif\"> and </span></span><a href=\"http://tvtropes.org/pmwiki/pmwiki.php/Main/SuperToughness\" target=\"_blank\">Super Toughness</a><span style=\"color:#000000\"><span style=\"font-family:sans-serif\"> to make an </span></span><a href=\"http://tvtropes.org/pmwiki/pmwiki.php/Main/ImplacableMan\" target=\"_blank\">Implacable Man</a><span style=\"color:#000000\"><span style=\"font-family:sans-serif\"> and </span></span><a href=\"http://tvtropes.org/pmwiki/pmwiki.php/Main/TheJuggernaut\" target=\"_blank\">The Juggernaut</a><span style=\"color:#000000\"><span style=\"font-family:sans-serif\">. </span></span><br /> <span style=\"color:#000000\"><span style=\"font-family:sans-serif\">Appearance: Dark brown skin, black eyes, black hair in an afro and big under canines jutting out from her lower lip. Her gauntlets have chains hanging off of them. </span></span><br /> <span style=\"color:#000000\"><span style=\"font-family:sans-serif\">History: They chained her, they dared chain her. She once bound free, without restraint, careless of walls or people or property and they took exception to that. And they chained her, like an animal that could be brought to heel! When she was freed by the gracious White Fang, she vowed never to be bound again, that she would destroy all the boundaries of humanity and faunus would run free, laughing and killing without restraint!</span></span>","signature":"","edited":{"userid":1252,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1252-god_of_awesome","user":"God_of_Awesome","date":". 05-25-2014, 08:25 AM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":2}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1252-god_of_awesome","name":"God_of_Awesome","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1252_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"570"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-05-23T19:37:52-07:00","id":147461,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Gryphon's Feather</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/11921-the-great-marriage-of-exalted-and-insert-fandom-here?p=133838#post133838\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">I hope this one isn't either too obscure or too obvious...<br /> <br /> A dynastic wedding almost done with it's preparations when a strangely dressed traveling apothecary slips appears uninvited, after hearing about the upcoming marriage, the apothecary offers the bride to be some of his wares, including some &quot;marriage aids&quot;.<br /> <br /> Later, when the bride crosses the threshold to be escorted to the wedding, she suddenly falls dead.<br /> <br /> At first, the house apprehends the apothecary for poisoning the bride, but after they find a bejeweled sword in his pack that stubbornly refuses to be drawn, the apothecary slips out of his bonds and reveals himself to be a thaumaturge, claiming the murder was caused by a spirit of some kind, and that he can slay it only is he can discover it's true form, it's motive for the killing, and the truth behind it's origin.<br /> <br /> Slowly his investigation leads to the clues he requires, and once the mystery is solved, he reveals himself as a changing moon caste lunar and confronts the rogue cat god responsible for it all.</div> </div> </div> </div>Bake Neko.<br /> <br /> Never seen it, but I HAVE seen some episodes of Mononoke, and the Medicine Seller was easy to recognize.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/815-kazorh","name":"Kazorh","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar815_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"900"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-05-24T17:36:09-07:00","id":148280,"title":"","content":"Bakeneko is correct, and by extension, Mononoke.<br /> <br /> The Medicine Seller could also be a sidereal, but I felt Lunar fit better, his other form even has the tattoos for it.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><b>Currently Playing:</b> <i>A large, mixed splat game of <b>CofD</b>.</i> <b>As:</b> Seraph du Salomon, Voice on the concordance. Unsubtle man reluctantly participating in the business of Magi. Awakening 2E homebrew <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/mage-the-awakening/1338514-house-du-salomon-a-proximus-dynasty?_=1569864567692\" target=\"_blank\">http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/m...=1569864567692</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2598-gryphon-s-feather","name":"Gryphon's Feather","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar2598_3.png","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Mar 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"215"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-05-26T03:07:03-07:00","id":149273,"title":"","content":"This would be my first time writing one of these, I hope it isn't too terrible.<br /> Let's see, wonder if someone will know this one:<br /> A young mortal is adopted by a mid level dynastic family. Though his disdain for his family is great, their resources allow the young mortal to learn much, becoming extraordinarily skilled in summoning at a young age. He summons a mid level demon to do his bidding. The demon is fairly friendly though surly at times. After stealing a powerful artifact from an earlier tormentor (due to his youth and status) the owner of the artifact burns down his home and kills his parents. The young boy only survives at the whim of his summoned demon. He vows to recover the artifact and reveal the plot against the state.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/3128-shaula","name":"Shaula","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"May 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"4"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-05-26T17:44:50-07:00","id":149869,"title":"","content":"Project Razor is not a new thing. Autochthonia made its bridge to Creation centuries, but it was too little, too late. The habitable parts of the pole of metal are largely gone, and most of the people who once inhabited the Maker are gone with it. But a single metropolis hurled itself toward the core--the least corrupted part of the Great Maker--and has remained there, waiting out the long death of Autochthon. It's been so long, in fact, that the people of this city no longer remember Creation, Now, though, the Maker's death is imminent. Thinking themselves having escaped the death of their world, the larger populace does nothing; only the youth of the city delve into ancient charms and structures to create a new Champion, the Moonsilver Caste <i>Ark of the New Dawn</i>. Charged with seeking out other survivors, others who might be able to save their dying city and dying world, <i>Ark's</i> journeys lead her to Creation, where she encounters a pair of mortals and a formerly enslaved Bronze Tiger. She's sure the people from this world can save hers, but the journey back is long, and others along the way won't make it any easier.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/561-mockery","name":"Mockery","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar561_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"876"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-05-27T14:58:05-07:00","id":150839,"title":"","content":"In the Modern Age of Creation, war breaks out in remote parts of the world with astonishing regularity. Certain merchants, especially those belonging to the Guild, see quite the profit in selling weapons to fuel these wars. As soldiers kill each other, innocents are often caught in the crossfire or made targets by unscrupulous commanders. It is only natural that these wars create orphans.<br /> <br /> One such orphan, a boy who was trained to hold a weapon before he could speak, has been Chosen by Luna for his devotion to his fellow orphans. He attacked an arms dealer, trying to take revenge for a girl who had been forced to the front lines to test a minefield. Though the merchant prince's bodyguards stopped him and locked him in a shipping crate, he emerged stronger, and cut a deal with the prince for the lives of his fellow orphans.<br /> <br /> Now, he serves as the child bodyguard to the prince's sister, an equally-devious weapons merchant who travels Creation with her elite team of bodyguards, including a former Haslanti commander who lost all her soldiers in a battle in the South, a former gunnery chief from An-Teng, a man who used to be a police sniper, and many others. But this mortal woman has a very devious plan, one that only she knows the details of, and she has grown very, <i>very</i> attached to the little boy soldier assigned to her. Each job, however far removed from each other, seems to be part of a grander scheme, one that may put even the Sidereals to shame... if anyone knew what the goal was.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><a href=\"http://archiveofourown.org/works/2480852/chapters/5503997\" target=\"_blank\">Glorious Echeladder Ascension Technique</a> - <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/287292-glorious-echeladder-ascension-technique-a-homestuck-exalted-crossover\" target=\"_blank\">Forum Topic</a><br /> <br /> &quot;Look, sometimes you just are in the mood to play the divinely empowered champion of the God of Farts. Mechanically optimized play is not the only way to enjoy playing your character.&quot; -Wise Old Guru","edited":{"userid":1048,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1048-ryumaru","user":"Ryumaru","date":". 05-27-2014, 06:10 PM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1048-ryumaru","name":"Ryumaru","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1048_2.png","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"326"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-05-27T20:22:01-07:00","id":150980,"title":"","content":"Jormungandr?","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>formerly Tornado Wolf, formerly Inugami","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/636-sunder-the-gold","name":"Sunder the Gold","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar636_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"5515"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-05-28T02:12:43-07:00","id":151142,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Sunder the Gold</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/11921-the-great-marriage-of-exalted-and-insert-fandom-here?p=150980#post150980\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Jormungandr?</div> </div> </div> </div>That would be it. I haven't totally finished it (only a few episodes away) but... yeah. Whatever Miss Hekmatyar is planning, it can't be good....","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><a href=\"http://archiveofourown.org/works/2480852/chapters/5503997\" target=\"_blank\">Glorious Echeladder Ascension Technique</a> - <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/287292-glorious-echeladder-ascension-technique-a-homestuck-exalted-crossover\" target=\"_blank\">Forum Topic</a><br /> <br /> &quot;Look, sometimes you just are in the mood to play the divinely empowered champion of the God of Farts. Mechanically optimized play is not the only way to enjoy playing your character.&quot; -Wise Old Guru","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1048-ryumaru","name":"Ryumaru","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1048_2.png","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"326"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-06-01T09:32:18-07:00","id":155702,"title":"","content":"(I hope we haven't been here yet, It's getting unwieldy to check I'm not doubling up)<br /> <br /> The fate of the world turns on the action of a Solar with an artifical limb. It was severed when he was very young by his brother, who went on to Exalt as an Air Aspect, and he survived only due to the kind intervention of an Abyssal, though she taunts him at each and every opportunity. He is fated to duel a girl made of swords, but which one? A Chosen of Secrets thinks he's pulling the strings, but there may be other Sidereals who treat him as a puppet in turn.<br /> <br /> In the 'B plot' ... but that would be telling. <img src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/smilies/smile.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" title=\"Smile\" smilieid=\"1\" class=\"inlineimg\" />","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1849-suddenthunder","name":"SuddenThunder","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1849_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"563"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-06-01T12:10:27-07:00","id":155800,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>SuddenThunder</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/11921-the-great-marriage-of-exalted-and-insert-fandom-here?p=155702#post155702\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">(I hope we haven't been here yet, It's getting unwieldy to check I'm not doubling up)<br /> <br /> The fate of the world turns on the action of a Solar with an artifical limb. It was severed when he was very young by his brother, who went on to Exalt as an Air Aspect, and he survived only due to the kind intervention of an Abyssal, though she taunts him at each and every opportunity. He is fated to duel a girl made of swords, but which one? A Chosen of Secrets thinks he's pulling the strings, but there may be other Sidereals who treat him as a puppet in turn.<br /> <br /> In the 'B plot' ... but that would be telling. <img src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/smilies/smile.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" title=\"Smile\" smilieid=\"1\" class=\"inlineimg\" /></div> </div> </div> </div>BlazBlue.<br /> <br /> <br /> <br /> ...","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>formerly Tornado Wolf, formerly Inugami","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/636-sunder-the-gold","name":"Sunder the Gold","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar636_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"5515"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-06-01T12:17:15-07:00","id":155829,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Sunder the Gold</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/11921-the-great-marriage-of-exalted-and-insert-fandom-here?p=155800#post155800\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">BlazBlue.<br /> <br /> <br /> <br /> ...</div> </div> </div> </div><b>THE WHEEL OF FATE IS TURNING!</b><br /> <br /> <span style=\"font-size:8px\">Which is to say, yes.</span>","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1849-suddenthunder","name":"SuddenThunder","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1849_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"563"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-06-01T14:09:18-07:00","id":155936,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>God_of_Awesome</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/11921-the-great-marriage-of-exalted-and-insert-fandom-here?p=147233#post147233\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><b>Team YOZI</b></div> </div> </div> </div>Damn it, why can't I Like this more than once?","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/815-kazorh","name":"Kazorh","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar815_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"900"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-06-11T06:37:12-07:00","id":165859,"title":"","content":"During the Age of Dreams, a number of Celestials founded a city-state in the West, the heart of a maritime empire. They built great ships and engines, and extended the scope of Creation further out into the Wyld.<br /> <br /> Alas, it was not to last, and when the Aftershock War began, one of the early campaigns saw the destruction of the city and its lords beneath the overwhelming hordes of the Last Primordial. The Celestials were not idle, though, and loaded the bulk of the populace on board all the transports they could recall, and sent them fleeing into the West before the city was fully besieged. One of them, a Twilight, laid her will upon the Wyld and Shaped a great fog to hide their passage, which would later foil all attempts to return.<br /> <br /> The tailmost squadron, carrying the refugees from the Thirteenth Precinct, became separated in a storm in the Bordermarches, and were not seen again. <br /> <br /> The other ships continued, however, until after long voyaging they found a green and pleasant island chain, with a full dozen demesnes just waiting for intrepid Terrestrials to found new settlements. The scientists among the survivors used their knowledge of Essence to cap the demesnes, and to mount the Reality Engines from the largest wyldfaring transports within the manses they built.<br /> <br /> Over the next centuries (time does not seem to match up with that in Creation, what with the Cascading Years event and the nonlinear speed-of-narrative that happens in much of the Wyld) the survivors' culture grew, as their Terrestrial champions used the base of High First Age infrastructure hastily loaded onto the transports to found a new civilization.<br /> <br /> Eventually, a traders\u2019 expedition made contact with a society of pelagothropes (not unusual in itself) and found them engaged in an ongoing war. A Terrestrial warrior went with a pelagothrope column, to find that the enemy were Dragon Kings, who surprisingly were most upset to see a Dragon-Blooded anima, shrieking about treason and usurpation and attacking without thought of their own survival.<br /> <br /> The war has lasted a thousand years, with the Dragon Kings having seemingly been wiped out, and the conflict carried on mostly by their Brass Legionnaire servants, presumably built in automated factory-cathedrals by the automata themselves. Also a product of the High First Age, the Legionnaires mostly use three-crew skimmers (for Archery, Sail, and War/Awareness specialists respectively - but otherwise quite like the flying car in CoCD:Yu Shan with a pair of linked implosion bows) to do battle with the settlers\u2019 own Air-Aspect-piloted motonic fightercraft.<br /> <br /> Recently, not long after the Fourth Fleet centred on the battleship <i>Hippopteryx</i> was wiped out, a settler merchant brought word to the Council that the enemy finally sought an armistice. A temporary cease-fire has held, and now the President has joined the main fleet to go to sign a formal peace treaty. Hopefully this will usher in a new age of peace for the settlers, perhaps one in which the President's academy classmate, the near-retired commander of another battleship, could fulfil his dream of searching out the descendants of the lost Thirteenth.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/3255-jqp","name":"jqp","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jun 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-06-11T16:15:24-07:00","id":166316,"title":"","content":"Battlestar Galactica?","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1419-wardragon","name":"WarDragon","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1419_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1052"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-06-12T15:59:59-07:00","id":167318,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>WarDragon</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/11921-the-great-marriage-of-exalted-and-insert-fandom-here?p=166316#post166316\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Battlestar Galactica?</div> </div> </div> </div>Yup. The old series, too. The one with Fred Astaire.<br /> <br /> A Sidereal is desperate to free an Eastern kingdom from the influence of a Deathlord and her foremost Abyssal, when a young woman's Second Breath produces an Air environmental effect of such magnitude that it kills the Deathknight outright. The Siddie (probably a Jovian) lends a hand as the Terrestrial teams up with a beastman, an elemental, and a Legionnaire automaton to try to find the Deathlord's secret weakness in the kingdom's demonic capital.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/3255-jqp","name":"jqp","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jun 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-06-16T15:00:38-07:00","id":171064,"title":"","content":"A young man (who has a subtle Night caste Essence inside of him) is forced to work for a criminal lord in his town until he picks the pocket of an Abyssal swordsman (with a Soulsteel arm) visiting town. This leads to a sequence of events where the young criminal's sister, his only family, is killed, before the Abyssal murders the criminal lord. The burgeoning Night caste follows the Abyssal on his quest to acquire 12 magical items that can be made into a potent elixir that can make the partaker invulnerable, or return life to the dead. Joining them is a Chosen of Saturn gunman and a heroic mortal reporter.<br /> <br /> -----<br /> <br /> An Exalt - none are sure if he is a Wood-Blood or a Gaian Exalt, though he also bears the blessing of Saturn - currently lives in a moderate-sized southern town. He holds a magical blade designed to cut any armor which can also bind others to tell the truth, and has held it against one of his home Gods for ages. His foe, meanwhile, has sought aid from the Yozi and the Fair Folk to hunt this blade, and is preparing to enter the field himself. Together with his Abyssal and Lunar associates, who act as his legal advisors, and a strange ghost of a Sidereal using her strange magics to inhabit the body of a mortal barmaid, the Exalt must meet his ancient foe in battle once and for all.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":1407,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1407-endlesskng","user":"EndlessKng","date":". 06-16-2014, 06:08 PM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1407-endlesskng","name":"EndlessKng","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"335"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-06-16T18:36:09-07:00","id":171266,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>jqp</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/11921-the-great-marriage-of-exalted-and-insert-fandom-here?p=167318#post167318\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">A Sidereal is desperate to free an Eastern kingdom from the influence of a Deathlord and her foremost Abyssal, when a young woman's Second Breath produces an Air environmental effect of such magnitude that it kills the Deathknight outright. The Siddie (probably a Jovian) lends a hand as the Terrestrial teams up with a beastman, an elemental, and a Legionnaire automaton to try to find the Deathlord's secret weakness in the kingdom's demonic capital.</div> </div> </div> </div>Wizard of Oz?","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>formerly Tornado Wolf, formerly Inugami","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/636-sunder-the-gold","name":"Sunder the Gold","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar636_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"5515"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-06-16T18:58:41-07:00","id":171296,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>EndlessKng</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/11921-the-great-marriage-of-exalted-and-insert-fandom-here?p=171064#post171064\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">An Exalt - none are sure if he is a Wood-Blood or a Gaian Exalt, though he also bears the blessing of Saturn - currently lives in a moderate-sized southern town. He holds a magical blade designed to cut any armor which can also bind others to tell the truth, and has held it against one of his home Gods for ages. His foe, meanwhile, has sought aid from the Yozi and the Fair Folk to hunt this blade, and is preparing to enter the field himself. Together with his Abyssal and Lunar associates, who act as his legal advisors, and a strange ghost of a Sidereal using her strange magics to inhabit the body of a mortal barmaid, the Exalt must meet his ancient foe in battle once and for all.</div> </div> </div> </div>Hounded, Book 1 of the Iron Druid series! Love those books.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1419-wardragon","name":"WarDragon","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1419_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1052"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-06-16T20:29:25-07:00","id":171339,"title":"","content":"<i>Once upon a time, there was a Yozi who slept. While he was awake, he had been foreseeing a story...</i><br /> <br /> There is a town, off on the frayed edges of Creation, where Fate and the Wyld mingle and warp each other into a peculiar sort of amalgam. In this town, Beastfolk openly walk the streets, and strange automata walk the streets, trading in gems of crystallized feelings. Chief among these wonders is a youth of surpassing beauty, who rarely speaks a word and whose face never betrays emotion. Only a handful of people know that this youth is really a mighty raksha prince who once did battle with Erembour herself and came out victorious, though at a terrible cost. The price of that victory was the shattering of the Prince's Graces, leaving him in the sorry state he is in today. This is the story of the Prince and the Exalts who love him.<br /> <br /> The first Exalt is a Sidereal, a Chosen of Battles. The odd pseudo-Fate that governs the town hid his destiny from Heaven, so he remains ignorant of his full potential. His love is a possessive love, tainted by fear, for he has foreseen a grave struggle in the Prince's life, as well as his own death in that struggle, and he now jealously guards the Prince against all who would, through their ignorance, bring these fates to pass.<br /> <br /> The second is a Casteless Lunar who Exalted when she learned to survive in the Demon Realm as a child. Her experiences there have left her broken, and Erembour's shadows lie heavy on her heart. There is no love without pain in Malfeas, but the Prince offers her an escape clause. In him she finds a placid, safe love, a love that asks for nothing and carries no surprises. In him, she is able to suppress her memories of Malfeas and forget the terrible oaths she swore at Erembour's feet. And she will stop at nothing to ensure her Prince remains as he is.<br /> <br /> The third is not truly an Exalt at all, but rather an odd sort of behemoth. Initially, she was just a bird whose lineage (if birds had ever cared about lineage) could be traced back to Beastmen. The blood of humanity is quite thin in her, but the strange metaphysics of the town amplified it to the point where she gained a human degree of sapience. She fell in love with the Prince as she watched him dance, unnoticed by all, and her feelings were so great, and so unusual, that the Wyld energies transformed her into a human girl. Her love is a naive sort of love, as could be expected from a creature born outside of humanity. She feels compelled to restore the Prince to what he once was, and she cares little for the status quo. She is the errant gust of wind that will blow this carefully-balanced house of cards to the ground and send the story spiraling into certain tragedy...<br /> <br /> <i>&quot;This is wonderful!&quot; said the Yozi who was supposed to be asleep!</i>","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":3}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1369-mewtarthio","name":"Mewtarthio","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"182"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-06-16T20:40:14-07:00","id":171348,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Mewtarthio</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/11921-the-great-marriage-of-exalted-and-insert-fandom-here?p=171339#post171339\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><i>Once upon a time, there was a Yozi who slept. While he was awake, he had been foreseeing a story...</i></div> </div> </div> </div>I recognize Princess Tutu when I see it. ^_^<br /> <br /> EDIT: 'cause this was my first entry on the old forums &quot;Marriage of Exalted and [Fandom]&quot; topic:<br /> <div style=\"margin: 5px 20px 5px 20px;\"> <div style=\"margin-bottom:2px; font-size: 80%;\"> <input type=\"button\" value=\"Spoiler\" style=\"width:45px;font-size:10px;margin:0px;padding:0px;\" onClick=\"if (this.parentNode.parentNode.getElementsByTagName('div')[1].getElementsByTagName('div')[0].style.display != '') { this.parentNode.parentNode.getElementsByTagName('div')[1].getElementsByTagName('div')[0].style.display = ''; this.innerText = ''; this.value = 'Hide'; } else { this.parentNode.parentNode.getElementsByTagName('div')[1].getElementsByTagName('div')[0].style.display = 'none'; this.innerText = ''; this.value = 'Show'; }\" /> </div> <div style=\" margin: 0px; padding: 6px; border: 3px groove blue; -webkit-border-radius: 10px; -moz-border-radius: 10px; border-radius: 10px; -webkit-box-shadow: 1px 1px 5px rgba(50, 50, 50, 0.75); -moz-box-shadow: 1px 1px 5px rgba(50, 50, 50, 0.75); box-shadow: 1px 1px 5px rgba(50, 50, 50, 0.75);\"> <div style=\"display: none;\"><div style=\"background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.8); padding: 6px; -webkit-border-radius: 10px; -moz-border-radius: 10px; border-radius: 10px;\"><span style=\"color:#404040\"><span style=\"font-family:Verdana\"><span style=\"font-size:11px\">In another time, a young woman discovers that a handsome and kind--if also lethargic and listless--young man in her village is a Lawgiver from the end of the Second Age, who sealed away the Ebon Dragon with his own virtues. This worked, but has left him effectively soul-eaten.</span></span></span><br /> <br /> <span style=\"color:#404040\"><span style=\"font-family:Verdana\"><span style=\"font-size:11px\">Driven to return him to the hero he was meant to be, she Exalts as a Lunar and sets to work recovering the physical incarnation of his lost virtues. She quickly finds herself opposed by the Bronze Tiger's friend and his lover. In time, she discovers the friend to be a Chosen of Battles, who knows his fate is to be destroyed painfully and without purpose if and when the seal on the Shadow of All Things is released. The lover, on the other hand, fears the changes in the Lawgiver, and that he may fall for the graceful Changing Moon who has recently appeared. As the Ebon Dragon begins to touch the world again, she Exalts as a Fiend, but finds her love for the Solar bringing her into conflict with her patron, while her powers hurt the man she loves in terrible ways and nearly destroys him.</span></span></span><br /> <br /> <span style=\"color:#404040\"><span style=\"font-family:Verdana\"><span style=\"font-size:11px\">All of this, by the way, is orchestrated by an ancient Ishvara.</span></span></span></div></div> </div> </div>","signature":"","edited":{"userid":561,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/561-mockery","user":"Mockery","date":". 06-16-2014, 11:44 PM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/561-mockery","name":"Mockery","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar561_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"876"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-06-17T10:13:50-07:00","id":171743,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Hand-of-Omega</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/11921-the-great-marriage-of-exalted-and-insert-fandom-here?p=124940#post124940\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">My turn: A sailor aboard a Realm ship is the only survivor of a Lintha attack. He hangs on against all odds, until another Realm ship, owned by a Great House, comes...and passes him by, leaving him to die, for seemingly no reason. Filled with rage and hatred, and the determination to survive and gain his revenge on the ship, he Exalts as a Tiger-totemed Lunar, and makes his way to an island of Wyld Barbarians, where he is tattooed as a Full Moon. However, his direct attacks on the Great House fail, until he rescues a Night Caste thief. She convinces him to seek revenge against the *captain* of the ship instead of the ship itself, and a female Sidereal Chosen of Secrets helps him to create a new identity of a wealthy eccentric in order to get closer to the truth behind the ship's abandoning him, while evading the skull-faced, Final Veridiance-infected Abyssal investigating him...which unfortunately leads him to fall in love with the blind albino Demon-Blooded daughter of the House patriarch...</div> </div> </div> </div>Sooo...since no one ever got mine, does that mean I win?<img src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/smilies/wink.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" title=\"Wink\" smilieid=\"4\" class=\"inlineimg\" />","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/681-hand-of-omega","name":"Hand-of-Omega","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar681_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2747"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-06-17T10:40:44-07:00","id":171763,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Hand-of-Omega</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/11921-the-great-marriage-of-exalted-and-insert-fandom-here?p=171743#post171743\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Sooo...since no one ever got mine, does that mean I win?<img src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/smilies/wink.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" title=\"Wink\" smilieid=\"4\" class=\"inlineimg\" /></div> </div> </div> </div>Depends on how you see things. :P<br /> <br /> It sounds pretty interesting, though, what is it?","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/815-kazorh","name":"Kazorh","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar815_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"900"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-06-17T10:50:46-07:00","id":171769,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Mockery</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/11921-the-great-marriage-of-exalted-and-insert-fandom-here?p=171348#post171348\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">EDIT: 'cause this was my first entry on the old forums &quot;Marriage of Exalted and [Fandom]&quot; topic:<br /> <div style=\"margin: 5px 20px 5px 20px;\"> <div style=\"margin-bottom:2px; font-size: 80%;\"> <input type=\"button\" value=\"Spoiler\" style=\"width:45px;font-size:10px;margin:0px;padding:0px;\" onClick=\"if (this.parentNode.parentNode.getElementsByTagName('div')[1].getElementsByTagName('div')[0].style.display != '') { this.parentNode.parentNode.getElementsByTagName('div')[1].getElementsByTagName('div')[0].style.display = ''; this.innerText = ''; this.value = 'Hide'; } else { this.parentNode.parentNode.getElementsByTagName('div')[1].getElementsByTagName('div')[0].style.display = 'none'; this.innerText = ''; this.value = 'Show'; }\" /> </div> <div style=\" margin: 0px; padding: 6px; border: 3px groove blue; -webkit-border-radius: 10px; -moz-border-radius: 10px; border-radius: 10px; -webkit-box-shadow: 1px 1px 5px rgba(50, 50, 50, 0.75); -moz-box-shadow: 1px 1px 5px rgba(50, 50, 50, 0.75); box-shadow: 1px 1px 5px rgba(50, 50, 50, 0.75);\"> <div style=\"display: none;\"><div style=\"background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.8); padding: 6px; -webkit-border-radius: 10px; -moz-border-radius: 10px; border-radius: 10px;\"><span style=\"color:#404040\"><span style=\"font-family:Verdana\"><span style=\"font-size:11px\">In another time, a young woman discovers that a handsome and kind--if also lethargic and listless--young man in her village is a Lawgiver from the end of the Second Age, who sealed away the Ebon Dragon with his own virtues. This worked, but has left him effectively soul-eaten.</span></span></span><br /> <br /> <span style=\"color:#404040\"><span style=\"font-family:Verdana\"><span style=\"font-size:11px\">Driven to return him to the hero he was meant to be, she Exalts as a Lunar and sets to work recovering the physical incarnation of his lost virtues. She quickly finds herself opposed by the Bronze Tiger's friend and his lover. In time, she discovers the friend to be a Chosen of Battles, who knows his fate is to be destroyed painfully and without purpose if and when the seal on the Shadow of All Things is released. The lover, on the other hand, fears the changes in the Lawgiver, and that he may fall for the graceful Changing Moon who has recently appeared. As the Ebon Dragon begins to touch the world again, she Exalts as a Fiend, but finds her love for the Solar bringing her into conflict with her patron, while her powers hurt the man she loves in terrible ways and nearly destroys him.</span></span></span><br /> <br /> <span style=\"color:#404040\"><span style=\"font-family:Verdana\"><span style=\"font-size:11px\">All of this, by the way, is orchestrated by an ancient Ishvara.</span></span></span></div></div> </div> </div></div> </div> </div> </div>Heh. I like how the only thing we have in common is Fakir as a Chosen of Battles.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1369-mewtarthio","name":"Mewtarthio","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"182"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-06-17T22:23:53-07:00","id":172463,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Kazorh</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/11921-the-great-marriage-of-exalted-and-insert-fandom-here?p=171763#post171763\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> Depends on how you see things. :P<br /> <br /> It sounds pretty interesting, though, what is it?</div> </div> </div> </div>It looks like <a href=\"http://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/The_Stars_My_Destination\" target=\"_blank\">The Stars My Destination.</a> Granted, that required breaking out some google-fu, and so may be wholly inaccurate.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/561-mockery","name":"Mockery","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar561_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"876"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-06-17T22:25:29-07:00","id":172466,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Mewtarthio</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/11921-the-great-marriage-of-exalted-and-insert-fandom-here?p=171769#post171769\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> Heh. I like how the only thing we have in common is Fakir as a Chosen of Battles.</div> </div> </div> </div><br /> Yeah, but that was the easiest one to wrangle: A character who can and does fight, but clearly isn't intended to be on the front lines, is at the mercy of Fate, and works best controlling things behind the scenes. Totally Chosen of Battles.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/561-mockery","name":"Mockery","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar561_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"876"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-06-18T12:02:30-07:00","id":173034,"title":"","content":"Yes, that one was Hounded, from the Druid Chronicles <img src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/smilies/biggrin.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" title=\"Big Grin\" smilieid=\"3\" class=\"inlineimg\" /><br /> <br /> Hopefully no one has done this one...<br /> <br /> A despotic Fire Aspect has set her self up as the ruler of the various Realm academies, and slowly makes plans to invade the others. As she rules, a strange newcomer attempts to attack her with a Red Jade Daiklave, but is easily beaten by an agent of the ruler's Earth-caste bodyguard, barely escaping with her life to the ruins of her father's demense. There, she discovers a very unique piece of armor, which also manages to bring with it her own Abyssal Exaltation, one that is independent from the Deathlords. Together with a effervescent mortal and the aid of a strange infiltrator amongst the staff (who seems to despise clothing), the Abyssal must uncover the secrets of her family's demise and stop the plots at foot in the academies and elsewhere.<br /> <br />","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1407-endlesskng","name":"EndlessKng","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"335"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-06-18T12:18:12-07:00","id":173048,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>EndlessKng</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/11921-the-great-marriage-of-exalted-and-insert-fandom-here?p=173034#post173034\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"> Hopefully no one has done this one... A despotic Fire Aspect has set her self up as the ruler of the various Realm academies, and slowly makes plans to invade the others. As she rules, a strange newcomer attempts to attack her with a Red Jade Daiklave, but is easily beaten by an agent of the ruler's Earth-caste bodyguard, barely escaping with her life to the ruins of her father's demense. There, she discovers a very unique piece of armor, which also manages to bring with it her own Abyssal Exaltation, one that is independent from the Deathlords. Together with a effervescent mortal and the aid of a strange infiltrator amongst the staff (who seems to despise clothing), the Abyssal must uncover the secrets of her family's demise and stop the plots at foot in the academies and elsewhere.</div> </div> </div> </div> On the one hand I want to say i'd seen Kill La Kill on this topic before, but that would have been before i saw the series--relatively recently--and so i'm very not sure about that.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/561-mockery","name":"Mockery","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar561_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"876"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-07-03T13:43:25-07:00","id":187377,"title":"","content":"A Twilight-Caste sorceress and her companions--a kind and puissant (but also rather dense) Dawn, a virtuous (but overdramatic) Zenith, and a pragmatic (perhaps<i> too</i> much so) Casteless Lunar--find themselves caught up in the struggle between a powerful Mountain Folk Warrior, who has unlocked the memories--and with it, some of the Unshaped power--of his pre-Creation existence, and one of his old companions from the Wyld, who seeks to manipulate the sorceress into unleashing the purest chaos upon Creation and in so doing, end it. They will encounter ancient dragons, shattered gods, a shadowland of the city they saw destroyed, royal intrigue, and a mysterious monk who seems inclined to help them...but not so inclined to explain exactly who sent him or why. <br /> <span style=\"color:#FFFFFF\">That is a secret.</span>","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/561-mockery","name":"Mockery","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar561_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"876"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-07-03T16:56:20-07:00","id":187513,"title":"","content":"Hello, Slayers.<br /> <br /> <br /> Bizzare black-armored titans cruise the skies of Creation, spreading out from their invasion of the East beneath the necrotic clouds of black-smoke hurricanes, throwing back every attempt to thwart them and driving wave after wave of refugee before them with blasts of blood-red light. A desperate team of savants, drawn from Lookshy, the Realm, and all the rest of Creation threw together a desperate stopgap - a new type of artifact, which can be produced in numbers enough to let entire dragons of essence users rise into the skies to battle the invaders, finally striking back against the menace.<br /> <br /> Now, a letter from the deceased leader of that team has reached his daughter in her home in the West, and she is sailing east to discover if her father yet lives, in the company of the deadly warrior who was the first user of his creation. At the end of her journey she will find danger, heartbreak, and true friends - a girl from the Hundred Kingdoms with the voice of an angel, a solemn champion of fallen Lookshy and her far more frivolous comrade, a young and irreverent god-blood from Great Forks and a speed-crazed Marukani, a near-silent Sijani ghost-blood and a fortune-telling daughter of Greyfalls - and a young dragonblood of the Realm, determined to defend her home and desperately afraid she'll be unable to carry her own weight.<br /> <br /> And maybe, just maybe, she'll be able to come to terms with these invaders who are neither dead nor live as Creation knows life...","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>I\u00e4! I\u00e4! Moe fthagn!","edited":{"userid":280,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/280-valles","user":"Valles","date":". 07-03-2014, 08:02 PM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/280-valles","name":"Valles","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar280_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"677"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-07-03T17:09:16-07:00","id":187519,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Valles</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/11921-the-great-marriage-of-exalted-and-insert-fandom-here?p=187513#post187513\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Bizzare black-armored titans cruise the skies of Creation, spreading out from their invasion of the East beneath the necrotic clouds of black-smoke hurricanes, throwing back every attempt to thwart them and driving wave after wave of refugee before them with blasts of blood-red light. A desperate team of savants, drawn from Lookshy, the Realm, and all the rest of Creation threw together a desperate stopgap - a new type of artifact, which can be produced in numbers enough to let entire dragons of essence users rise into the skies to battle the invaders, finally striking back against the menace.<br /> <br /> Now, a letter from the deceased leader of that team has reached his daughter in her home in the West, and she is sailing east to discover if her father yet lives, in the company of the deadly warrior who was the first user of his creation. At the end of her journey she will find danger, heartbreak, and true friends - a girl from the Hundred Kingdoms with the voice of an angel, a solemn champion of fallen Lookshy and her far more frivolous comrade, a young and irreverent god-blood from Great Forks and a speed-crazed Marukani, a near-silent Sijani ghost-blood and a fortune-telling daughter of Greyfalls - and a young dragonblood of the Realm, determined to defend her home and desperately afraid she'll be unable to carry her own weight.<br /> <br /> And maybe, just maybe, she'll be able to come to terms with these invaders who are neither dead nor live as Creation knows life...</div> </div> </div> </div>Strike <span style=\"font-size:8px\">(Forest)</span> Witches.<br /> <br /> The lost magic of the Old Realm is dangerous, and those who possess the know-how to use it crush all others under their boots. Yet, the downtrodden may yet have hope, for there are tales of a band of five that punishes the excesses of these sorcerous tyrants. Of course, if other tales are true, they're also dysfunctional to the extreme, as one spends most of his time hitting on any woman in sight, two are intent on keeping the skirt-chaser to themselves and violently punish him for his attempts and philandering, and another is quite preoccupied with the sight of himself in the mirror.<br /> <br /> For all their bungling, however, the prosaic methods used by this group of five, combined with the lech's peculiar use of Deadly Beastman Transformation, can end any individual oppressor where they stand. Occasionally, the group receives support from other champions in their organization, including a gender non-observing Fire Aspect whose pursuit of the hornball makes him as uncomfortable as his attentions make countless young women.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":23,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/23-saur-ops-specialist","user":"Saur Ops Specialist","date":". 07-03-2014, 08:19 PM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/23-saur-ops-specialist","name":"Saur Ops Specialist","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar23_3.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"9371"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-07-03T17:19:42-07:00","id":187526,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Saur Ops Specialist</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/11921-the-great-marriage-of-exalted-and-insert-fandom-here?p=187519#post187519\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Strike <span style=\"font-size:8px\">(Forest)</span> Witches.</div> </div> </div> </div>Correct. I'm watching the second season right now, and actually enjoying myself a hell of a lot. You wouldn't think that a show that throws around this many underpants could be this <i>charming</i>, but it is, and as a WW2 buff the little historical nods make me giggle.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>I\u00e4! I\u00e4! Moe fthagn!","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/280-valles","name":"Valles","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar280_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"677"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-07-03T19:18:28-07:00","id":187576,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Saur Ops Specialist</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/11921-the-great-marriage-of-exalted-and-insert-fandom-here?p=187519#post187519\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll