small number of Celestial Exaltations, just in time. A young Zenith heeds the visions of his Sidereal brother, and sways a number of his people to abandon their town before disaster strikes. The best fighter in town, who has Exalted as a Full Moon, deserts the town's police force and joins them in their perilous trek across Creation. <br /> <br /> They encounter many dangers and lose many followers, esp at a town where the people sacrifice random citizens to the local gods for prosperous crops. But eventually, they find the perfect place the Sidereal foresaw, a great place to build anew. However, their population is dangerously small, and so they enact a plan to help people escape from a nearby kingdom that is being ruled by a Chosen of Malfeas king with an iron hand. <br /> <br /> The Full Moon goes undercover, enlisting as an officer in this kingdom's army, and succeeds in escaping with a number of its people. However, the Slayer king leads an assault force to besiege our heroes' town. While the Full Moon battles the Slayer to a stand-still, the Zenith nearly loses his life leading a ravenous Behemoth to the town to wreak havoc among the Slayer's forces...","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/681-hand-of-omega","name":"Hand-of-Omega","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar681_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2747"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-07-03T23:58:37-07:00","id":187755,"title":"","content":"Watership Down. <br /> <br /> I guessed it was that by the last sentence of the first paragraph, and the rest just clinched it.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2005-cosar","name":"CoSaR","avatar":"data:i