o draw <a href=\"https://probably-unreliable.tumblr.com/tagged/Jenart\" target=\"_blank\">Exalted</a> things and is looking for commission works ~","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/298-jen","name":"Jen","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar298_5.jpg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"3487"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-07-07T11:09:38-07:00","id":190490,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Valles</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/11921-the-great-marriage-of-exalted-and-insert-fandom-here?p=187513#post187513\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Hello, Slayers.</div> </div> </div> </div>Yep. Second season, to be precise. Totally would have skinned Sylphiel as a Joybringer if I'd gotten around to her.<br /> <br /> <br /> <br />","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/561-mockery","name":"Mockery","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar561_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"876"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-07-09T03:04:21-07:00","id":192219,"title":"","content":"<br /> <div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Jen</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/11921-the-great-marriage-of-exalted-and-insert-fandom-here?p=189149#post189149\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> Sky High ?</div> </div> </div> </div>Yes. Now that I think about it, Ron would have made a great Chosen of Journeys...<br /> <br /> A young Chosen of Secrets is called in to investigate a corpse. Through a rather contrived and historically inaccurate series of events, he discovers a bomb hidden in the Imperial City (planted by a secret Twilight conspiracy) and becomes embroiled in a plot to murder the head of the Immaculate Order.<br /> The plot involves various high-ranking Order members being assassinated in ways that deliberately mock their respective elements.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":476,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/476-argonometra","user":"Argonometra","date":".  Adding new idea. 07-17-2014, 07:02 AM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/476-argonometra","name":"Argonometra","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"534"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-07-24T14:45:16-07:00","id":207548,"title":"","content":"Argonometra, yours is Angels and Demons.<br /> <br /> <br /> A kingdom in the east isn't doing well. Along with being nearly surrounded by the Wyld, It's greatest treasures (three artifacts from the First Age) have been stolen over the past decade or two, and to top it off the king is dying without an heir. The king calls his most loyal servant, an Eclipse Caste magistrate with a kind and noble heart. The king tells the magistrate that if he can find the three lost First Age artifacts, he will become the new king. He sets off to find the artifacts, running into an Infernal sorceress who feeds on children, a Fair Folk thief, a gigantic Raksha who rules over a kingdom in the sky and an angry fire dragon.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>&quot;Oh boys! Look what I got here!&quot;<br /> &quot;Hey, where the Dynast women at?&quot;","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/814-dreamking89","name":"dreamking89","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"237"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-07-24T16:10:22-07:00","id":207632,"title":"","content":"...this is King's Quest, isn't it?","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/561-mockery","name":"Mockery","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar561_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"876"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-07-26T19:59:09-07:00","id":209760,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Mockery</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/11921-the-great-marriage-of-exalted-and-insert-fandom-here?p=207632#post207632\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">...this is King's Quest, isn't it?</div> </div> </div> </div>You got it.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>&quot;Oh boys! Look what I got here!&quot;<br /> &quot;Hey, where the Dynast women at?&quot;","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/814-dreamking89","name":"dreamking89","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"237"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-07-26T20:38:27-07:00","id":209780,"title":"","content":"(didn't scour through all 20 pages, hope this hasn't been covered)<br /> <br /> One mad sorcerer, in his quest for power, sundered all of Creation, leaving nothing behind; Yet the Yozis remain imprisoned and unsatisfied. Malfeas may have found a way - not out, but in. Combining his own infinite power with that of a Chosen One - one who was chosen by the Green Sun himself and has beaten every demon, ghost, spirit and every other aspirant into slaverous submission or a bloody pulp - he will create the world anew or sunder himself trying - opening his carcass onto all of Samsara in the pyroclastic process. The Chosen, on his journey to meet the Unconquered Sun in battle, discovers that there is another choice - the new world can be in the image of Malfeas, the Chosen's own Will, or in the image of the old world.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><span style=\"font-family:lucida sans unicode\">Bearer of the legacy of Trauma Bear<br /> Need a dice-roller? Check out <a href=\"http://bit.ly/dicemat\" target=\"_blank\">Dicemat</a>.</span>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/43-fata-ku","name":"Fata-Ku","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar43_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2240"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-07-27T20:13:12-07:00","id":210761,"title":"","content":"...Sounds like Shin Megami Tensei, though I can't say for sure. In other news:<br /> <br /> A young Autocthonian finds himself on a beach in Creation, trapped in an entirely foreign world. The island's inhabitants tell him that Autocthon has been dead for hundreds of years, and nothing remains of his resting place but ruins. The boy resolves to travel to these ruins, doing so with an odd party of pilgrims- a reserved Lunar shaman, a playful Water Aspect, a stoic sorceress, and a beastman exiled from the North. In doing so, he accidentally sparks the fall of the Immaculate Order, kills two Abyssals, and gives the shaman a reason to live (much to the annoyance of her friends).","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/476-argonometra","name":"Argonometra","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"534"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-07-28T14:13:28-07:00","id":211650,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Argonometra</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/11921-the-great-marriage-of-exalted-and-insert-fandom-here?p=210761#post210761\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">...Sounds like Shin Megami Tensei, though I can't say for sure. In other news:<br /> <br /> A young Autocthonian finds himself on a beach in Creation, trapped in an entirely foreign world. The island's inhabitants tell him that Autocthon has been dead for hundreds of years, and nothing remains of his resting place but ruins. The boy resolves to travel to these ruins, doing so with an odd party of pilgrims- a reserved Lunar shaman, a playful Water Aspect, a stoic sorceress, and a beastman exiled from the North. In doing so, he accidentally sparks the fall of the Immaculate Order, kills two Abyssals, and gives the shaman a reason to live (much to the annoyance of her friends).</div> </div> </div> </div>FFX. (Word limit)","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>formerly Tornado Wolf, formerly Inugami","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/636-sunder-the-gold","name":"Sunder the Gold","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar636_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"5515"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-08-02T20:48:10-07:00","id":217141,"title":"","content":"So an Abyssal, a Solar, a Alchemical, and a Lunar walk into a spaceship...no, I'll try again.<br /> <br /> A princess sold into slavery Exalts as an Infernal and escapes her captors, destroying buildings in her desperation. The commotion attracts four other Exalts, who decide to hunt down the slavers and, eventually, form a circle to protect their city.<br /> (They're later joined by an insecure Earth Aspect, but that doesn't last.)","signature":"","edited":{"userid":476,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/476-argonometra","user":"Argonometra","date":". 08-05-2014, 08:45 PM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/476-argonometra","name":"Argonometra","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"534"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-08-03T13:48:08-07:00","id":217573,"title":"","content":"Teen Titans.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>formerly Tornado Wolf, formerly Inugami","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/636-sunder-the-gold","name":"Sunder the Gold","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar636_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"5515"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-08-05T17:45:25-07:00","id":219678,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Sunder the Gold</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/11921-the-great-marriage-of-exalted-and-insert-fandom-here?p=217573#post217573\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Teen Titans.</div> </div> </div> </div>Yes.<br /> <br /> A son of the Threshold, despite being unExalted, rises to prominence in the Realm through his magnificent tactical and scientific skill. Unknown to all except his Water Aspect mother and Lunar mate, a barbarian tribeswoman, this boy is actually a Twilight Caste.<br /> But a storm is on the horizon. An army of Fae are preparing to attack the Realm, and only the boy's genius can fend them off...","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/476-argonometra","name":"Argonometra","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"534"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-08-05T18:12:17-07:00","id":219703,"title":"","content":"Let's try this again, no one got it the first time, probably just lost to time:<br /> A young mortal is adopted by a mid level dynastic family. Though his disdain for his family is great, their resources allow the young mortal to learn much, becoming extraordinarily skilled in summoning at a young age. He summons a mid level demon to do his bidding. The demon is fairly friendly though surly at times. After stealing a powerful artifact from an earlier tormentor (due to his youth and status) the owner of the artifact burns down his home and kills his parents. The young boy only survives at the whim of his summoned demon. He vows to recover the artifact and reveal the plot against the state.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/3128-shaula","name":"Shaula","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"May 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"4"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-08-05T20:55:12-07:00","id":219814,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Argonometra</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/11921-the-great-marriage-of-exalted-and-insert-fandom-here?p=219678#post219678\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> Yes.<br /> <br /> A son of the Threshold, despite being unExalted, rises to prominence in the Realm through his magnificent tactical and scientific skill. Unknown to all except his Water Aspect mother and Lunar mate, a barbarian tribeswoman, this boy is actually a Twilight Caste.<br /> But a storm is on the horizon. An army of Fae are preparing to attack the Realm, and only the boy's genius can fend them off...</div> </div> </div> </div>Codex Alera.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1419-wardragon","name":"WarDragon","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1419_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1052"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-08-05T22:46:20-07:00","id":219881,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>CoSaR</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/11921-the-great-marriage-of-exalted-and-insert-fandom-here?p=187755#post187755\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Watership Down.<br /> <br /> I guessed it was that by the last sentence of the first paragraph, and the rest just clinched it.</div> </div> </div> </div>Knew I should have gone with &quot;Mrs. Brisby and the Rats of NIMH&quot;!<img src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/smilies/tongue.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" title=\"Stick Out Tongue\" smilieid=\"5\" class=\"inlineimg\" /><br /> <br /> In the Modern Age, Sidereals and Abyssals have come to an Accord, whereby the Seers patrol the nights, keeping the Creatures of Darkness to certain guidelines of behavior so that they don't prey on mankind too much, while Deathknights patrol the day, keeping the Viziers from interfering in man's Destiny. <br /> <br /> Our hero, a mid-level Sidereal, must navigate the treacherous waters of bureaucratic intrigue, while being used as a pawn by both his boss, an ancient Sidereal, and the head Abyssal elder, and also deal with finding love with a newly Exalted Solar sorceress of extraordinary power...","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/681-hand-of-omega","name":"Hand-of-Omega","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar681_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2747"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-08-06T06:50:14-07:00","id":220118,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Hand-of-Omega</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/11921-the-great-marriage-of-exalted-and-insert-fandom-here?p=219881#post219881\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> Knew I should have gone with &quot;Mrs. Brisby and the Rats of NIMH&quot;!<img src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/smilies/tongue.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" title=\"Stick Out Tongue\" smilieid=\"5\" class=\"inlineimg\" /><br /> <br /> In the Modern Age, Sidereals and Abyssals have come to an Accord, whereby the Seers patrol the nights, keeping the Creatures of Darkness to certain guidelines of behavior so that they don't prey on mankind too much, while Deathknights patrol the day, keeping the Viziers from interfering in man's Destiny.<br /> <br /> Our hero, a mid-level Sidereal, must navigate the treacherous waters of bureaucratic intrigue, while being used as a pawn by both his boss, an ancient Sidereal, and the head Abyssal elder, and also deal with finding love with a newly Exalted Solar sorceress of extraordinary power...</div> </div> </div> </div>Nightwatch?","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2005-cosar","name":"CoSaR","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jan 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"136"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-08-13T03:30:23-07:00","id":226889,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>WarDragon</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/11921-the-great-marriage-of-exalted-and-insert-fandom-here?p=219814#post219814\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> Codex Alera.</div> </div> </div> </div>Yes.<br /> -<br /> A Dawn Caste tribal princess and her bow-wielding Lunar mate, defend their clan against an army led by a raven-totemed Full Moon. To do so, the princess takes up an artefact sword, which is said to be of divine origin. It slaughters her foes effortlessly, but at terrible cost: it was crafted for one Exalt alone, and whoever else wields it will die within days.<br /> She decides it is worth the cost.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/476-argonometra","name":"Argonometra","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"534"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-08-13T05:24:02-07:00","id":226950,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div c