r.com/projects...d-hood-diaries</a><br /> <br /> <br /> A wolf-totemed Lunar takes vengeance on her father's killer, a mad Alchemical. Leaving the shelter of her Wood-Aspected grandmother, she travels into the heart of Autochthonia, battling his crude mechanical soldiers all the way.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/476-argonometra","name":"Argonometra","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"534"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-08-28T10:59:44-07:00","id":243286,"title":"","content":"In the Modern Age, popular entertainment is made of watching heroic Dragon-Bloods who, while lacking military discipline, still possess heroic motives and skills. Broadcast live as they stop various villains and criminals, these heroes are part superhero, part marketing extravaganza, and part celebrity. One hero lacks discipline, causing monumental property damage over his career, and when his contract is sold as his sponsor company goes out of business, he ends up partnered with a new, up-and-coming hero with the exact same Charms. The difference between the two? The vet is in this because he wants to help people, while the new guy is in it as a business. He doesn't even use a code name!<br /> <br /> Something lurks in the shadows, though, threatening more than the duo's strained relationship. The newcomer hides a grudge for the murder of his parents, and a shadowy organization has to have been behind it. This organization's tendrils have gotten into more than any hero could expect, however, and may reach into the very top levels of their government... or possibly even the entire hero business.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><a href=\"http://archiveofourown.org/works/2480852/chapters/5503997\" target=\"_blank\">Glorious Echeladder Ascension Technique</a> - <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/287292-glorious-echeladder-ascension-technique-a-homestuck-exalted-crossover\" target=\"_blank\">Forum Topic</a><br /> <br /> &quot;Look, sometimes you just are in the mood to play the divinely empowered champion of the God of Farts. Mechanically optimized play is not the only way to enjoy playing your character.&quot; -Wise Old Guru","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1048-ryumaru","name":"Ryumaru","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1048_2.png","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"326"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-08-28T16:05:07-07:00","id":243474,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Ryumaru</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/11921-the-great-marriage-of-exalted-and-insert-fandom-here?p=243286#post243286\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">In the Modern Age, popular entertainment is made of watching heroic Dragon-Bloods who, while lacking military discipline, still possess heroic motives and skills. Broadcast live as they stop various villains and criminals, these heroes are part superhero, part marketing extravaganza, and part celebrity. One hero lacks discipline, causing monumental property damage over his career, and when his contract is sold as his sponsor company goes out of business, he ends up partnered with a new, up-and-coming hero with the exact same Charms. The difference between the two? The vet is in this because he wants to help people, while the new guy is in it as a business. He doesn't even use a code name!<br /> <br /> Something lurks in the shadows, though, threatening more than the duo's strained relationship. The newcomer hides a grudge for the murder of his parents, and a shadowy organization has to have been behind it. This organization's tendrils have gotten into more than any hero could expect, however, and may reach into the very top levels of their government... or possibly even the entire hero business.</div> </div> </div> </div>Tiger and Bunny.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/476-argonometra","name":"Argonometra","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"534"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-08-29T22:57:25-07:00","id":244556,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Argonometra</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/11921-the-great-marriage-of-exalted-and-insert-fandom-here?p=243474#post243474\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> Tiger and Bunny.</div> </div> </div> </div>Yeah, got it in one!<br /> <br /> Okay, new one:<br /> <br /> A manse discovered near Nexus has become an extremely popular entertainment site, having been converted into a restaurant. It has even been discovered to have working First Age automata to serve and entertain guests! However, the manse's power systems are failing. During the day, when the Daystar can provide it energy to spare, it keeps the automata in pristine working condition... but at night, the essence fields keeping the automata in check collapse, unable to be sustained without proper power. The machines have begun to believe that they are the proper shape of living things, and that humans are simply the bare bones of a mechanical exoskeleton that needs a proper covering, one to match their own razor-sharp-metal-filled suits.<br /> <br /> All of this is discovered by a lone security guard, set to watch over the manse at night. With dwindling power, he must keep the automata from reaching him and forcing him into a deathtrap, relying only on the surveillance systems and faulty door locks to keep the murderous machines away from him.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><a href=\"http://archiveofourown.org/works/2480852/chapters/5503997\" target=\"_blank\">Glorious Echeladder Ascension Technique</a> - <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/287292-glorious-echeladder-ascension-technique-a-homestuck-exalted-crossover\" target=\"_blank\">Forum Topic</a><br /> <br /> &quot;Look, sometimes you just are in the mood to play the divinely empowered champion of the God of Farts. Mechanically optimized play is not the only way to enjoy playing your character.&quot; -Wise Old Guru","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1048-ryumaru","name":"Ryumaru","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1048_2.png","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"326"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-08-31T18:18:43-07:00","id":245746,"title":"","content":"Five Nights at Freddie's?","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><b>Currently Playing:</b> <i>A large, mixed splat game of <b>CofD</b>.</i> <b>As:</b> Seraph du Salomon, Voice on the concordance. Unsubtle man reluctantly participating in the business of Magi. Awakening 2E homebrew <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/mage-the-awakening/1338514-house-du-salomon-a-proximus-dynasty?_=1569864567692\" target=\"_blank\">http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/m...=1569864567692</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2598-gryphon-s-feather","name":"Gryphon's Feather","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar2598_3.png","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Mar 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"215"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-09-01T23:16:12-07:00","id":246666,"title":"","content":"I believe I did this one on the old forums, but here goes anyway.<br /> <br /> The Reclamation has begun. Spearheaded by the Ebon Dragon himself, the Realm's forces are quickly wiped out by his great power. Eventually, a lone Dawn Caste rides forward to fight the Yozi, wielding a sword from the Primordial War that first cast down the Ebon Dragon. The Yozi and the Solar fought for what seemed like years, but the Ebon Dragon could not stand against the might of the Solar and the legendary weapon.<br /> <br /> However, the Yozi's treachery knows no bounds. Before the warrior struck the final blow, the Ebon Dragon trapped him in a First Age stasis crystal and flung him across Creation. Uncountable centuries later, the warrior is freed from the stasis crystal and finds a very alien Creation where the Ebon Dragon's evil is law. Armed with the only known weapon able to harm the Yozi, the Dawn Caste sets out to defeat the Ebon Dragon once and for all, helping those tormented by him along the way.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>&quot;Oh boys! Look what I got here!&quot;<br /> &quot;Hey, where the Dynast women at?&quot;","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/814-dreamking89","name":"dreamking89","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"237"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-09-02T01:36:52-07:00","id":246705,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Gryphon's Feather</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/11921-the-great-marriage-of-exalted-and-insert-fandom-here?p=245746#post245746\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Five Nights at Freddie's?</div> </div> </div> </div>Ding! We have a winner!<br /> <br /> <div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>dreamking89</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/11921-the-great-marriage-of-exalted-and-insert-fandom-here?p=246666#post246666\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">I believe I did this one on the old forums, but here goes anyway.<br /> <br /> The Reclamation has begun. Spearheaded by the Ebon Dragon himself, the Realm's forces are quickly wiped out by his great power. Eventually, a lone Dawn Caste rides forward to fight the Yozi, wielding a sword from the Primordial War that first cast down the Ebon Dragon. The Yozi and the Solar fought for what seemed like years, but the Ebon Dragon could not stand against the might of the Solar and the legendary weapon.<br /> <br /> However, the Yozi's treachery knows no bounds. Before the warrior struck the final blow, the Ebon Dragon trapped him in a First Age stasis crystal and flung him across Creation. Uncountable centuries later, the warrior is freed from the stasis crystal and finds a very alien Creation where the Ebon Dragon's evil is law. Armed with the only known weapon able to harm the Yozi, the Dawn Caste sets out to defeat the Ebon Dragon once and for all, helping those tormented by him along the way.</div> </div> </div> </div>Would this Dawn Caste happen to be a &quot;foooooooooolish samurai warrior?&quot;<br /> Because I'm pretty sure that's Samurai Jack.<br />","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><a href=\"http://archiveofourown.org/works/2480852/chapters/5503997\" target=\"_blank\">Glorious Echeladder Ascension Technique</a> - <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/287292-glorious-echeladder-ascension-technique-a-homestuck-exalted-crossover\" target=\"_blank\">Forum Topic</a><br /> <br /> &quot;Look, sometimes you just are in the mood to play the divinely empowered champion of the God of Farts. Mechanically optimized play is not the only way to enjoy playing your character.&quot; -Wise Old Guru","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1048-ryumaru","name":"Ryumaru","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1048_2.png","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"326"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-09-02T09:03:43-07:00","id":246847,"title":"","content":"I don't see how it could be anything else. (Mind you, Aku is generally how I visualize the Ebon Dragon anyway.)","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/3505-matt-the-bruins-fan","name":"Matt the Bruins fan","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar3505_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jul 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2401"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-09-02T11:33:02-07:00","id":246982,"title":"","content":"While a prominent local family and owner of a mansion-Manse holds a private soiree between its daughter and her friends, secret police in the government become aware of the family being influenced by the forces of a deathknight. In order to avoid the corruption's spread, the police force recruits a specialist in scrying and defeating wards in order to turn the family's greatest asset - its Manse - against them, hijacking its defenses with geomantic rituals and using them to dispatch of the blood-hungry, reanimated corpses roaming through the complex's hidden passageways. However, this thaumaturge's loyalties might be a tad more suspect than the security forces were bargaining for...","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/23-saur-ops-specialist","name":"Saur Ops Specialist","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar23_3.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"9371"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-09-07T23:21:06-07:00","id":252002,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Matt the Bruins fan</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/11921-the-great-marriage-of-exalted-and-insert-fandom-here?p=246847#post246847\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">I don't see how it could be anything else. (Mind you, Aku is generally how I visualize the Ebon Dragon anyway.)</div> </div> </div> </div>I'm glad I'm not the only one.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>&quot;Oh boys! Look what I got here!&quot;<br /> &quot;Hey, where the Dynast women at?&quot;","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/814-dreamking89","name":"dreamking89","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"237"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-09-15T06:01:59-07:00","id":257231,"title":"","content":"<span style=\"font-size:14px\"><b>Terrifying Argent Witchblade</b></span><br /> <br /> Creation has fallen to a dark time. The Ebon Dragon, understanding the limits of his prison, asked of his brothers that he be wholly forged into a single Exaltation, which would wreck destruction upon creation and be carried through a single family line: one of sins and chaos. Seeing the power wrought upon by The Ebon Darkness, Sol Invictus took the same steps as his enemy and gathered all of his exaltations to fuse back with him and become one. Sol Angelus was born and carried the purest light with it. The fight between both forces went on for decades, destroying everything in its path. At some point, The maidens contacted Luna and told her that they saw a future, a future in which either of them won, but destroyed everything.<br /> <br /> And so Luna took the same steps as Sol and the Dragon, gathering all her forces to before a single gauntlet of power, a balancing force between good and evil, a tool of ultimate adaptation which would serve only to make sure the balance was kept. Thus was born the Argent Witchblade.<br /> <br /> With time, the war torn appart sky and land, but creation still stood. Other gods, demons and elementals decided to take the Forging and become invulnerable Artifacts, but recently the world discovered one of terrible power. The Thirteenth one was created by the Deathlords conspiring against one of their own, soul-crafting him into a single sphere of pure Soulsteel. Now, the maidens have told their Sidereals that no matter what happens, the power of all these items should never be gathered together, as that would be terrible and omen the end of the world...","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Glorious Useless-Post Prana<br /> <span style=\"font-family:MercuryTextG2\">Cost: 2</span><span style=\"font-family:MercuryTextG2\">m; </span><span style=\"font-family:MercuryTextG2\">Mins: </span><span style=\"font-family:MercuryTextG2\">Linguistics 1, Essence 1 </span><span style=\"font-family:MercuryTextG2\">Type: </span><span style=\"font-family:MercuryTextG2\">Simple</span><br /> <span style=\"font-family:MercuryTextG2\">Keywords: </span><span style=\"font-family:MercuryTextG2\">Mute</span><br /> <span style=\"font-family:MercuryTextG2\">Duration: </span><span style=\"font-family:MercuryTextG2\">Instant</span><br /> <span style=\"font-family:MercuryTextG2\">Prerequisite Charms: </span><span style=\"font-family:MercuryTextG2\">Ten-Characters Methodology</span>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2589-magnum-opus","name":"Magnum Opus","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar2589_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Mar 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"821"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-09-16T01:06:50-07:00","id":257971,"title":"","content":"An extremely eccentric Eclipse Caste writer has become obsessed with capturing the spirit of the Scavenger Lands with pen and quill. He heads to the city of Great Forks with his Sidereal protector, planning to chronicle the legendary five-day Calibration festival being held there. However, the two Exalted bring with them a wagon filled to bursting with opium, marijuana, alcohol and a collection of strange substances apprehended from the Wyld and Fair Folk nobles. They spend the five days of Calibration in a drug-fueled binge, encountering Dragon Kings, strange demon-summoning rituals, twisted entertainment created by spirits and other unusual sights. Though it is impossible to tell what is the festival and what is the visions of their own drug-clouded minds.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>&quot;Oh boys! Look what I got here!&quot;<br /> &quot;Hey, where the Dynast women at?&quot;","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/814-dreamking89","name":"dreamking89","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"237"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-09-16T09:48:42-07:00","id":258245,"title":"","content":"&quot;We were somewhere around Nexus, on the banks of the Yanaze, when the drugs began to take hold. I remember saying something a bit like this...&quot;","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>I\u00e4! I\u00e4! Moe fthagn!","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/280-valles","name":"Valles","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar280_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"677"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-09-17T21:01:41-07:00","id":259476,"title":"","content":"This is gonna take some narrative backflips, so I hope it's not lost in the shuffle...<br /> <br /> Near the end of the First Age, a powerful Twilight Caste peered into the Loom of Fate, seeing the Reclamation millenia in the future. Knowing that creation would need assistance in fighting back the demons, he begun work on a great weapon: a powerful warstrider that could take on the greatest of behemoths and Third Circle demons on it's own. However, when the Ursurpation occured, the Solar inventor launched the warstrider from his palace so that it could never fall into the wrong hands. A young Chosen of Battles, knowing of the visions of the Reclamation, stole the Solar's Gem of Immortality and set off on a journey to find the legendary warstrider: a journey that could take her thousands of years....<br /> <br /> Thousands of years later, the ruined warstrider is found on the outskirts of Nexus by a young Twilight Caste and his mortal best friend. Seeking a 'project' to work on, the Solar repairs the warstrider, gutting the controls in the process and adding his own. When the Sidereal reaches Nexus, she attempts to take the warstrider only to find out she no longer knows how to drive it. With the Reclamation fast approaching, the Sidereal vows to train the Solar in proper combat so he can stand against the Yozi and their armies. However, the Twilight Caste is more interested in lazing about and enjoying the many vices available in Nexus. What's most frustrating for the Sidereal is that despite this carefree attitude, the Twilight is able to handle the numerous threats to Nexus with relative competence. <br /> <br />","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>&quot;Oh boys! Look what I got here!&quot;<br /> &quot;Hey, where the Dynast women at?&quot;","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/814-dreamking89","name":"dreamking89","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"237"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-09-17T22:40:49-07:00","id":259550,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>dreamking89</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/11921-the-great-marriage-of-exalted-and-insert-fandom-here?p=259476#post259476\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">This is gonna take some narrative backflips, so I hope it's not lost in the shuffle...</div> </div> </div> </div><i>Nice</i>.<br /> <br /> By which I mean, of course, Megas XLR.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>I\u00e4! I\u00e4! Moe fthagn!","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/280-valles","name":"Valles","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar280_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"677"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-09-22T20:48:55-07:00","id":263371,"title":"","content":"On the shore of a tiny island in the Southwestern ocean, a beastman, the victim of numerous experiments by a deranged Defiler bent on mutating various animals into beastman soldiers, washes ashore. Aided by the god of the islands, who manifests as a floating mask, the beastman must return to the Defiler's laboratory in order to save his beloved from the twisted experiments. Only his agility, jumping skills, and bizarre spinning ability can help him defeat the Defiler's servants and ascend to the peak of the castle where the mad doctor awaits....","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divi