e":"2014-10-28T16:01:32-07:00","id":295353,"title":"","content":"Oh, it's a song? <i>99 Luftballons</i>.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":97,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/97-the-mg","user":"The MG","date":". 10-29-2014, 05:47 AM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/97-the-mg","name":"The MG","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar97_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2460"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-10-28T20:35:02-07:00","id":295584,"title":"","content":"A Liminal awakens in Sijian, his only companion a sapient artefact skull. He remembers nothing of who he is or when he Exalted, but his prodigious power level- and immunity to death of all kinds- implies that he's been Chosen for a very long time. Hounded by hungry ghosts, he searches for his identity, eventually assembling a Circle of mismatched allies: a Changing Moon beastwoman, a demon-blooded Chosen of Serenity, a mad Fire Aspect, a enslaved Moonsilver Caste, and stranger creatures still.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":2}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/476-argonometra","name":"Argonometra","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"534"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-10-28T21:04:35-07:00","id":295597,"title":"","content":"Planescape: Torment, also one of the best video game adaptations of D&amp;D ever.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/3976-silent-witness","name":"Silent Witness","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar3976_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Oct 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"138"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-10-28T21:06:01-07:00","id":295598,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Argonometra</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/11921-the-great-marriage-of-exalted-and-insert-fandom-here?p=295584#post295584\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">A Liminal awakens in Sijian, his only companion a sapient artefact skull. He remembers nothing of who he is or when he Exalted, but his prodigious power level- and immunity to death of all kinds- implies that he's been Chosen for a very long time. Hounded by hungry ghosts, he searches for his identity, eventually assembling a Circle of mismatched allies: a Changing Moon beastwoman, a demon-blooded Chosen of Serenity, a mad Fire Aspect, a enslaved Moonsilver Caste, and stranger creatures still.</div> </div> </div> </div>Planescape: Torment.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/23-saur-ops-specialist","name":"Saur Ops Specialist","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar23_3.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"9371"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-10-28T21:51:54-07:00","id":295609,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Mockery</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/11921-the-great-marriage-of-exalted-and-insert-fandom-here?p=291802#post291802\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Taking a page from Ryumaru:<br /> <br /> <i>Once there was a careless Maiden...</i><br /> <br /> Who loosed her signs upon the Heavens.<br /> &quot;Behold these portents!&quot; The people beneath shouted.<br /> In them, ministers saw war, and coveted power.<br /> In them, warriors saw battle, and sought glory.<br /> And so the world came to ruin.<br /> <br /> The Maiden looked upon the wreckage,<br /> Finding where one of her signs had fallen to the earth<br /> And cast it once more into the sky.</div> </div> </div> </div>I knew it! That's 99 Red Balloons: Nena's famous anti-balloon protest song!","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>&quot;Oh boys! Look what I got here!&quot;<br /> &quot;Hey, where the Dynast women at?&quot;","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/814-dreamking89","name":"dreamking89","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"237"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-10-28T23:53:16-07:00","id":295656,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Silent Witness</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/11921-the-great-marriage-of-exalted-and-insert-fandom-here?p=295597#post295597\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Planescape: Torment, also one of the best video game adaptations of D&amp;D ever.</div> </div> </div> </div>Yes and yes.<br /> -<br /> Far from the Realm's paranoid eyes, there is a small medieval kingdom ruled by the Gold Faction. Few know this place for what it is: a training ground, a refuge for nascent Solars.<br /> The story is told from the perspective of a shy, repressed Eclipse Caste who recently Exalted, and was promptly taken by a local air spirit to this wondrous place. The other Solars are quick to welcome the Eclipse and offer her protection- partly because they knew her previous incarnation...and bore witness to his sudden assassination. As the Eclipse searches for his killers, she must also overcome the trauma of her childhood and master her newfound powers.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/476-argonometra","name":"Argonometra","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"534"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-10-29T02:16:20-07:00","id":295678,"title":"","content":"In the morrow land of valleys and mountains, the breaking of the jade prison has destroyed the old ways of the world, reconfiguring the axiomatic laws of the World, preventing electricity, gunpowder and steam to bear their usual power - the fate of nations is once again decided by iron and blood and the grit and willpower of their leader.<br /> The incarnae only seem to have disappeared, claimed by death or slumber in the old age, but powerful Gods have taken their place - representing Their aspects and Their will in a muddier way than they used to, but no less effective, no less potent.<br /> <br /> With the end of the jade prison, Malfeas stirs, and the cosmic malevolence of the Yozi slowly remembers the bitterness of their imprisonment. After eons of slumber, this has evolved into a hate for Creation on a scale that only cosmic entities can comprehend, and they are sending their agents in the world to hasten its destruction, and - they hope, their release.<br /> <br /> To oppose them, the champion of the Old Powers, blessed by Sol of the Long Arm, blessed by Raven, friend of the Dragons and their folk, half-caste son of a Dawn General and an Eclipse bard Queen of the Old Religion, tutored by the best warrior-general and the best assassin of his era, healed and mentored by Chosens of Serenity and Battle, he who travelled the length of the Realm to retrieve the Daiklave of Power that once was his badge of office and marks him as the Champion, claiming his Zenith exaltation as a result.<br /> He is accompanied by his kin and friends - his archer Wolf-totem Lunar mate, his Dragon-Blooded Queen, his twin Night sisters, and many others - a wandering Lunar warrior of great tenacity and mental resilience, the exiled son of a Dawn King who inherited the exaltation of his father, the Lunar King of a far and cold northern land, his Chosen of Battles advisor and chancellor...<br /> <br /> Together they fight the darkness of the Yozis and their cults in the land of Valley and Mountain.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":1609,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1609-fumble","user":"Fumble","date":". 10-29-2014, 05:19 AM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1609-fumble","name":"Fumble","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1609_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"57"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-10-29T16:31:15-07:00","id":296284,"title":"","content":"Oooh, Oooh! It's the Emberverse, aka the world of the Change, by S.M. Stirling! I love those books!<br /> <br /> Nice calls on the Exaltations for Rudi and company.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1419-wardragon","name":"WarDragon","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1419_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1052"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-10-29T20:19:32-07:00","id":296437,"title":"","content":"Time to indulge in my strange sense of humor.<br /> <br /> One's a high-Essence Zenith caste who can summon as many gods or elementals as he needs at any time.<br /> <br /> The other is a heroic mortal with ride 5.<br /> <br /> Together, they fight crime!","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><b>Currently Playing:</b> <i>A large, mixed splat game of <b>CofD</b>.</i> <b>As:</b> Seraph du Salomon, Voice on the concordance. Unsubtle man reluctantly participating in the business of Magi. Awakening 2E homebrew <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/mage-the-awakening/1338514-house-du-salomon-a-proximus-dynasty?_=1569864567692\" target=\"_blank\">http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/m...=1569864567692</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2598-gryphon-s-feather","name":"Gryphon's Feather","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar2598_3.png","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Mar 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"215"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-10-29T22:03:41-07:00","id":296573,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Gryphon's Feather</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/11921-the-great-marriage-of-exalted-and-insert-fandom-here?p=296437#post296437\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Time to indulge in my strange sense of humor.<br /> <br /> One's a high-Essence Zenith caste who can summon as many gods or elementals as he needs at any time.<br /> <br /> The other is a heroic mortal with ride 5.<br /> <br /> Together, they fight crime!</div> </div> </div> </div><br /> ANGEL SUMMONER! <span style=\"font-size:8px\">and BMX Bandit.</span>","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/23-saur-ops-specialist","name":"Saur Ops Specialist","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar23_3.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"9371"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-11-02T01:52:05-08:00","id":299865,"title":"","content":"A Lunar priestess remains untattooed after her Exaltation, and begins to fall into chimerism. She flees civilization with her Dawn Caste bondmate, journeying to a far-off fortress that is inhabited by feral demons. The only way for her to remain human is to eat the flesh of these demons.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/476-argonometra","name":"Argonometra","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"534"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-11-02T11:28:50-08:00","id":300235,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Argonometra</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/11921-the-great-marriage-of-exalted-and-insert-fandom-here?p=299865#post299865\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">A Lunar priestess remains untattooed after her Exaltation, and begins to fall into chimerism. She flees civilization with her Dawn Caste bondmate, journeying to a far-off fortress that is inhabited by feral demons. The only way for her to remain human is to eat the flesh of these demons.</div> </div> </div> </div>Frankly, I always thought Mavda was more Lunar than Elena. But Chimerism is as good a representation as anything for what happens to her.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/561-mockery","name":"Mockery","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar561_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"876"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-11-02T11:50:24-08:00","id":300249,"title":"","content":"Pandora's tower, that was a good game.<br /> <br /> Edit: Scourge'd.<br /> <br /> A young man becomes a mercenary alongside a childhood friend, seeking silver in battle in a region where most would seek glory. Blaming the local goddess of battle for his farther's death, he seeks her out on the battlefields, and nearly gets himself killed for his trouble, only to be saved by a bemused deathlord. The deathlord offers him a deal, should he accept the the Dusk exaltation she offers, he has a single year to kill the goddess before he must serve her army in the underworld.<br /> <br /> Unable to refuse, he is granted a hecatonchire to guide him, and a single black feather. Should he gather enough death essence, the feather shall become a daiklave capable of permanently slaying the goddess.<br /> <br /> With war looming on the horizon, will he sacrifice those he cares about for a chance at vengeance?<br />","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><b>Currently Playing:</b> <i>A large, mixed splat game of <b>CofD</b>.</i> <b>As:</b> Seraph du Salomon, Voice on the concordance. Unsubtle man reluctantly participating in the business of Magi. Awakening 2E homebrew <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/mage-the-awakening/1338514-house-du-salomon-a-proximus-dynasty?_=1569864567692\" target=\"_blank\">http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/m...=1569864567692</a>","edited":{"userid":2598,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2598-gryphon-s-feather","user":"Gryphon's Feather","date":". 11-02-2014, 03:08 PM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2598-gryphon-s-feather","name":"Gryphon's Feather","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar2598_3.png","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Mar 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"215"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-11-02T14:03:34-08:00","id":300436,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Mockery</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/11921-the-great-marriage-of-exalted-and-insert-fandom-here?p=300235#post300235\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> Frankly, I always thought Mavda was more Lunar than Elena. But Chimerism is as good a representation as anything for what happens to her.</div> </div> </div> </div>They both could be Lunars. It's just that Elena is more protagonist-y.<br /> -<br /> During the First Age, a handful of elder Exalts (and their mortal peons) abandoned Creation in hopes of establishing a new world, a celestial colony that each planned to mold according to their own beliefs. They numbered seven: a fierce Chosen of Battles, a serene No Moon, a merciless Twilight, a idealistic Eclipse, a paranoid Earth Caste, a fanatic Zenith, and a wealthy Waxing Moon.<br /> However, their starship is destroyed upon arrival, and the Exalts find themselves scattered and afraid on a foreign, deadly world. Desperate for survival, they quickly declare war on each other- contending not only with other humans, but their lack of supplies, their moral codes, and the gradually dawning realization that they are not alone...","signature":"","edited":{"userid":476,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/476-argonometra","user":"Argonometra","date":". 11-03-2014, 03:47 AM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/476-argonometra","name":"Argonometra","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"534"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-11-18T00:06:54-08:00","id":315098,"title":"","content":"A Half-Caste woman with a strange birth defect is marked to become a Sidereal. While she shows promising skill in sorcery and thatamurgy while training at the Heptagram, her birth defect leaves her shunned by her peers, save for a beautiful Dynast sorceress also marked for Sidereal Exaltation. As the day to her Exaltation draws nearer, the Half-Caste becomes passionate about the Blessed Isle's recent beastmen population (and how horribly they are treated by Dragon Blooded and mortal alike). She discovers that many Beastmen are vanishing in the night, never to be seen again.<br /> <br /> Eventually, the Half-Caste and her Dynast friend are brought to Yu-Shan to meet Chejop Kejak, where they learn that the Gold Faction is kidnapping the Isle's beastmen in order to transform them into a new breed of 'soldier' for Yu-Shan and the Realm. Horrified by this, the Half-Caste steals a powerful First Age tome and escapes from Yu-Shan using the sorcery she knows, Exalting as a Twilight in the process. Now the Twilight finds herself becoming the most feared anathema in all of the Isle, while her friend (now a Sidereal) finds herself conflicted between being a part of the Gold Faction or remaining friends with the girl she knows is not the monster the Realm paints her to be.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>&quot;Oh boys! Look what I got here!&quot;<br /> &quot;Hey, where the Dynast women at?&quot;","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/814-dreamking89","name":"dreamking89","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"237"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-11-18T08:13:54-08:00","id":315391,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>dreamking89</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/11921-the-great-marriage-of-exalted-and-insert-fandom-here?p=315098#post315098\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">A Half-Caste woman with a strange birth defect is marked to become a Sidereal. While she shows promising skill in sorcery and thatamurgy while training at the Heptagram, her birth defect leaves her shunned by her peers, save for a beautiful Dynast sorceress also marked for Sidereal Exaltation. As the day to her Exaltation draws nearer, the Half-Caste becomes passionate about the Blessed Isle's recent beastmen population (and how horribly they are treated by Dragon Blooded and mortal alike). She discovers that many Beastmen are vanishing in the night, never to be seen again.<br /> <br /> Eventually, the Half-Caste and her Dynast friend are brought to Yu-Shan to meet Chejop Kejak, where they learn that the Gold Faction is kidnapping the Isle's beastmen in order to transform them into a new breed of 'soldier' for Yu-Shan and the Realm. Horrified by this, the Half-Caste steals a powerful First Age tome and escapes from Yu-Shan using the sorcery she knows, Exalting as a Twilight in the process. Now the Twilight finds herself becoming the most feared anathema in all of the Isle, while her friend (now a Sidereal) finds herself conflicted between being a part of the Gold Faction or remaining friends with the girl she knows is not the monster the Realm paints her to be.</div> </div> </div> </div><br /> <br /> Wicked. The idea of Chejop Kejak as the Wizard of Oz amuses me.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>I write things.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/3950-wonderandawe","name":"wonderandawe","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar3950_2.gif","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Sep 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"5410"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-11-22T01:14:33-08:00","id":318791,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Argonometra</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/11921-the-great-marriage-of-exalted-and-insert-fandom-here?p=300436#post300436\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> They both could be Lunars. It's just that Elena is more protagonist-y.<br /> -<br /> During the First Age, a handful of elder Exalts (and their mortal peons) abandoned Creation in hopes of establishing a new world, a celestial colony that each planned to mold according to their own beliefs. They numbered seven: a fierce Chosen of Battles, a serene No Moon, a merciless Twilight, a idealistic Eclipse, a paranoid Earth Caste, a fanatic Zenith, and a wealthy Waxing Moon.<br /> However, their starship is destroyed upon arrival, and the Exalts find themselves scattered and afraid on a foreign, deadly world. Desperate for survival, they quickly declare war on each other- contending not only with other humans, but their lack of supplies, their moral codes, and the gradually dawning realization that they are not alone...</div> </div> </div> </div><br /> Is this Lord of Light by Roger Zelazny?","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>&quot;Oh boys! Look what I got here!&quot;<br /> &quot;Hey, where the Dynast women at?&quot;","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/814-dreamking89","name":"dreamking89","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"237"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-11-25T14:26:07-08:00","id":322205,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>dreamking89</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/11921-the-great-marriage-of-exalted-and-insert-fandom-here?p=318791#post318791\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> <br /> Is this Lord of Light by Roger Zelazny?</div> </div> </div> </div>No, it's the game Sid Meier's Alpha Centauri.<br /> By the way, your sig quote is excellent.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/476-argonometra","name":"Argonometra","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"534"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-11-25T22:43:14-08:00","id":322422,"title":"","content":"Deep within the Imperial Mountain lies a sanctum, wherin Gaia placed a set of orbs made a crystallized form of pure elemental essence. During the Shogunate, as the images of the first age began to fade, two Fire aspect Dragon-blooded attempted to breach this sanctum, causing a cataclysmic reaction when they failed that nearly destroyed the Dragon-blooded community below. <br /> <br /> \u200ba few years later, three young Dragon-blooded visited a nearby Chosen of Secrets to study the sanctum. They succeed in breaching the sanctum, almost unwittingly, and begin collecting the orbs of elemental essence. before they can collect them all, the two Fire-aspects from before reappear in the company of a Water aspect and capture the Chosen of Secrets and one of the dragon-blooded, forcing the other two to turn over all the Orbs they'd collected.<br /> <br /> The two young DBs are then forced into an adventure across all of creation, seeking to prevent these renegade Dragonblooded from casting the orbs into the Elemental Poles, lest the Influx of elemental essence wreak havoc on Creation's diminished Dragon Lines. but perhaps all is not as it seems?","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>&quot;Life before Death, Strength before Weakness, Journey before Destination.&quot;<br /> <br /> <span style=\"color:#0000FF\">&quot;I will protect those who cannot protect themselves&quot;</span>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/4172-marros56","name":"Marros56","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar4172_2.png","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Oct 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"143"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-11-25T23:14:05-08:00","id":322453,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Marros56</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/11921-the-great-marriage-of-exalted-and-insert-fandom-here?p=322422#post322422\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Deep within the Imperial Mountain lies a sanctum, wherin Gaia placed a set of orbs made a crystallized form of pure elemental essence. During the Shogunate, as the images of the first age began to fade, two Fire aspect Dragon-blooded attempted to breach this sanctum, causing a cataclysmic reaction when they failed that nearly destroyed the Dragon-blooded community below.<br /> <br /> \u200ba few years later, three young Dragon-blooded visited a nearby Chosen of Secrets to study the sanctum. They succeed in breaching the sanctum, almost unwittingly, and begin collecting the orbs of elemental essence. before they can collect them all, the two Fire-aspects from before reappear in the company of a Water aspect and capture the Chosen of Secrets and one of the dragon-blooded, forcing the other two to turn over all the Orbs they'd collected.<br /> <br /> The two young DBs are then forced into an adventure across all of creation, seeking to prevent these renegade Dragonblooded from casting the orbs into the Elemental Poles, lest the Influx of elemental essence wreak havoc on Creation's diminished Dragon Lines. but perhaps all is not as it seems?</div> </div> </div> </div>Dragonball?","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/476-argonometra","name":"Argonometra","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"534"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-11-26T08:38:53-08:00","id":322840,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Argonometra</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/11921-the-great-marriage-of-exalted-and-insert-fandom-here?p=322453#post322453\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> Dragonball?</div> </div> </div> </div><br /> Nope. Hint: It's a video game.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>&quot;Life before Death, Strength before Weakness, Journey before Destination.&quot;<br /> <br /> <span style=\"color:#0000FF\">&quot;I will protect those who cannot protect themselves&quot;</span>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/4172-marros56","name":"Marros56","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar4172_2.png","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Oct 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"143"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-11-26T13:40:40-08:00","id":323142,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Marros56</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/11921-the-great-marriage-of-exalted-and-insert-fandom-here?p=322840#post322840\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> <br /> Nope. Hint: It's a video game.</div> </div> </div> </div>Oh! Golden Sun! It's definitely Golden Sun!","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Discord: HalfTangible#7505<br /> &quot;+3 Girlfriend is totally unoptimized. You are better off with a +1 Keen Witty girlfriend and then appling Greater Magic Make-up to increase her enhancement bonus.&quot; -Keld Danar on <a href=\"https://forums.giantitp.com/showthread.php?p=10856903#post10856903\" target=\"_blank\">GitP Forums</a><br /> Playing Peleps Raptor, Fire Aspect playboy in the Grand Tour","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/879-halftangible","name":"HalfTangible","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar879_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"366"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-11-26T20:51:28-08:00","id":323393,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>HalfTangible</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/11921-the-great-marriage-of-exalted-and-insert-fandom-here?p=323142#post323142\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> Oh! Golden Sun! It's definitely Golden Sun!</div> </div> </div> </div>Yes! so glad someone got that. That game needs more love.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>&quot;Life before Death, Strength before Weakness, Journey before Destination.&quot;<br /> <br /> <span style=\"color:#0000FF\">&quot;I will protect those who cannot protect themselves&quot;</span>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/4172-marros56","name":"Marros56","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar4172_2.png","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Oct 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"143"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-11-27T09:13:47-08:00","id":323663,"title":"","content":"An Infernal Caste destroys roughly a fourth of the blessed isle in an instant, sending it falling into the Wyld. At first, all the powers of the world try to kill him, but the Infernal is too fast and skilled to be killed by even the greatest solar assassins. He claims to be perfectly capable of destroying all of Creation, and threatens to do so at the end of Calibration. However, Chejop Kajak seeks him out to learn what he wants. The Infernal strikes a deal with him: He will be allowed to teach a very specific class of incredibly weak Dragon-Blooded, if that entire class is allowed to try and murder him throughout their lessons. In exchange, the Infernal will hold off on destroying the world until the next calibration.<br /> <br /> So the race is on: one class of dragon-blooded. Their goal: kill their teacher before Calibration.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Discord: HalfTangible#7505<br /> &quot;+3 Girlfriend is totally unoptimized. You are better off with a +1 Keen Witty girlfriend and then appling Greater Magic Make-up to increase her enhancement bonus.&quot; -Keld Danar on <a href=\"https://forums.giantitp.com/showthread.php?p=10856903#post10856903\" target=\"_blank\">GitP Forums</a><br /> Playing Peleps Raptor, Fire Aspect playboy in the Grand Tour","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/879-halftangible","name":"HalfTangible","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar879_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"366"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-11-27T09:53:57-08:00","id":323696,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>HalfTangible</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/11921-the-great-marriage-of-exalted-and-insert-fandom-here?p=323663#post323663\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">An Infernal Caste destroys roughly a fourth of the blessed isle in an instant, sending it falling into the Wyld. At first, all the powers of the world try to kill him, but the Infernal is too fast and skilled to be killed by even the greatest solar assassins. He claims to be perfectly capable of destroying all of Creation, and threatens to do so at the end of Calibration. However, Chejop Kajak seeks him out to learn what he wants. The Infernal strikes a deal with him: He will be allowed to teach a very specific class of incredibly weak Dragon-Blooded, if that entire class is allowed to try and murder him throughout their lessons. In exchange, the Infernal will hold off on destroying the world until the next calibration.<br /> <br /> So the race is on: one class of dragon-blooded. Their goal: kill their teacher before Calibration.</div> </div> </div> </div>Assassination Classroom.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/51-marin","name":"marin","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2019"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-11-28T00:11:17-08:00","id":324275,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Marros56</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/11921-the-great-marriage-of-exalted-and-insert-fandom-here?p=323393#post323393\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> Yes! so glad someone got that. That game needs more love.</div> </div> </div> </div>I don't know how it's possible to give hands-down the best game on the GBA more love, but I'll give it a shot.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>&quot;Oh boys! Look what I got here!&quot;<br /> &quot;Hey, where the Dynast women at?&quot;","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/814-dreamking89","name":"dreamking89","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"237"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-11-28T00:31:45-08:00","id":324281,"title":"","content":"The Reclamation has begun with a full-on strike on the Blessed Isle. Thanks to a powerful First Age defense system, the Isle is defended from the majority of the demon armies by a large force field, but numerous powerful 3rd Circle demons and their minions managed to reach the Isle before the shield activated. With their own armies faltering against the might of Malfeas, the Realm deploys their secret weapon: a team of 100 of the greatest Dragon Blooded warriors from across creation. Working as a team, the Dragon Blooded are able to use special Essence projectors to turn their collective power into large Essence-weapons to combat the Yozi armies. Now only they can stop the armies of the Reclamation before they reach the Imperial Manse and destroy the shield protecting the Blessed Isle from complete destruction. Among this special team include a headstrong Fire-Aspect martial artist who is commanding the team for the first time, a smooth talking Water-Aspect swordsman and a portly Woods Aspect with incredible Archery skills.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>&quot;Oh boys! Look what I got here!&quot;<br /> &quot;Hey, where the Dynast women at?&quot;","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/814-dreamking89","name":"dreamking89","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"237"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-11-28T19:42:57-08:00","id":324980,"title":"","content":"... the Wonderful 101?","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><a href=\"http://archiveofourown.org/works/2480852/chapters/5503997\" target=\"_blank\">Glorious Echeladder Ascension Technique</a> - <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/287292-glorious-echeladder-ascension-technique-a-homestuck-exalted-crossover\" target=\"_blank\">Forum Topic</a><br /> <br /> &quot;Look, sometimes you just are in the mood to play the divinely empowered champion of the God of Farts. Mechanically optimized play is not the only way to enjoy playing your character.&quot; -Wise Old Guru","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1048-ryumaru","name":"Ryumaru","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1048_2.png","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"326"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-12-01T12:27:36-08:00","id":327308,"title":"","content":"A young Sidereal, watching the Loom of Fate, falls in love from afar with a young man destined for Exaltation, though she knows he is destined for another. Try as she might, the whispers of Isidoros beckon to her, to take what she wants, and damn Fate and what it says.<br /> <br /> Knowing what awaits her if she says yes, but unable to bring herself to say no, she splinters her Fate, surrendering to the Black Boar, becoming one of his akuma, and tearing the Loom of Fate asunder to pull everything she can to bow before her. Demons and undead alike march to her will, along with a proud Elemental Dragon and a wicked Raksha, both kept tightly enthralled through sorcery. <br /> <br /> Normally, this might be overkill in the pursuit of just one young fresh Exalt. But not only does the object of her desire...well...<i>object</i>, the foreordained lover of her obsession is herself a puissant Eclipse with a loyal army at her beck and call. And then there's the Isidoros's own agenda; when the Sidereal's actions tear the fabric of Creation asunder such that time itself frays, she may find that the heroes across this Age and the one before gather to stop her...","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/561-mockery","name":"Mockery","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar561_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"876"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-12-01T15:26:53-08:00","id":327426,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Mockery</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/11921-the-great-marriage-of-exalted-and-insert-fandom-here?p=327308#post327308\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">A young Sidereal, watching the Loom of Fate, falls in love from afar with a young man destined for Exaltation, though she knows he is destined for another. Try as she might, the whispers of Isidoros beckon to her, to take what she wants, and damn Fate and what it says.<br /> <br /> Knowing what awaits her if she says yes, but unable to bring herself to say no, she splinters her Fate, surrendering to the Black Boar, becoming one of his akuma, and tearing the Loom of Fate asunder to pull everything she can to bow before her. Demons and undead alike march to her will, along with a proud Elemental Dragon and a wicked Raksha, both kept tightly enthralled through sorcery.<br /> <br /> Normally, this might be overkill in the pursuit of just one young fresh Exalt. But not only does the object of her desire...well...<i>object</i>, the foreordained lover of her obsession is herself a puissant Eclipse with a loyal army at her beck and call. And then there's the Isidoros's own agenda; when the Sidereal's actions tear the fabric of Creation asunder such that time itself frays, she may find that the heroes across this Age and the one before gather to stop her...</div> </div> </div> </div>Hyrule Warriors?","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/23-saur-ops-specialist","name":"Saur Ops Specialist","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar23_3.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"9371"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-12-01T20:42:22-08:00","id":327647,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Saur Ops Specialist</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/11921-the-great-marriage-of-exalted-and-insert-fandom-here?p=327426#post327426\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> Hyrule Warriors?</div> </div> </div> </div>Got it in one.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/561-mockery","name":"Mockery","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar561_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"876"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-12-01T21:48:11-08:00","id":327688,"title":"","content":"A Tiger Totem Lunar wandering the Wyld begins to succumb to its mental influence in a bizarre way when she encounters a local fae, whose form-fitting leggings she begins to believe to be a powerful artifact that would enhance her martial arts and athletics to world-shaking levels. She begins to obsess over obtaining a pair for herself.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>i don't know a hecking thing, my guy","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/4416-heedra","name":"Heedra","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar4416_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"68"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-12-04T09:36:40-08:00","id":330255,"title":"","content":"The elemental poles are consumed by the Wyld, and a crater appears where the Earth pole once was. A zenith caste solar sets out with her demon summon to close the chasm, purify the poles and save Creation before it rots away. She is quickly joined by her Lunar mate (who exalted when he survived the forming of the chasm), an idealistic Mars aspect, and a mysterious dawn caste with no memory but a book that reveals the future. Only when all the poles are purified, however, does the adventure truly begin...","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Discord: HalfTangible#7505<br /> &quot;+3 Girlfriend is totally unoptimized. You are better off with a +1 Keen Witty girlfriend and then appling Greater Magic Make-up to increase her enhancement bonus.&quot; -Keld Danar on <a href=\"https://forums.giantitp.com/showthread.php?p=10856903#post10856903\" target=\"_blank\">GitP Forums</a><br /> Playing Peleps Raptor, Fire Aspect playboy in the Grand Tour","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/879-halftangible","name":"HalfTangible","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar879_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"366"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-12-06T07:44:16-08:00","id":332217,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>HalfTangible</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/11921-the-great-marriage-of-exalted-and-insert-fandom-here?p=330255#post330255\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">The elemental poles are consumed by the Wyld, and a crater appears where the Earth pole once was. A zenith caste solar sets out with her demon summon to close the chasm, purify the poles and save Creation before it rots away. She is quickly joined by her Lunar mate (who exalted when he survived the forming of the chasm), an idealistic Mars aspect, and a mysterious dawn caste with no memory but a book that reveals the future. Only when all the poles are purified, however, does the adventure truly begin...</div> </div> </div> </div>Bravely Default!","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/155-noodle","name":"Noodle","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar155_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1415"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-12-08T03:46:43-08:00","id":334076,"title":"","content":"During the First Age, a Twilight summoned a host of spirits, both elemental and celestial, to bind them in an enchanted book.<br /> Many years after the Usurpation, his Shard's next incarnation- a young girl- discovers the book and inadvertently lets the spirits free. Confused and maddened by the time that has passed, they begin to wreak havoc on the unfamiliar world.<br /> The book's guardian spirit charges the girl with finding the escaped spirits and returning them to him. It is a mighty task, but she is not alone- a fledgling Chosen of Serenity, an amnesiac avatar of Luna, and a mystic No Moon (who happens to be related to her prior incarnation) are guided by fate to the girl, and become caught up in her quest.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/476-argonometra","name":"Argonometra","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"534"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-12-08T07:59:36-08:00","id":334214,"title":"","content":"Card Captor Sakura.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>formerly Tornado Wolf, formerly Inugami","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/636-sunder-the-gold","name":"Sunder the Gold","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar636_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"5515"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-12-08T10:59:36-08:00","id":334350,"title":"","content":"All Hell has broken loose. A rite of Sorcery meant to merge the Underworld and the living one via sacrificing the Mouth of Piece has gone horribly wrong, ripping a giant portal to Malfeas in the sky. Thankfully for Creation, the sole witness and survivor of the rite, seems to have a smaller portal embedded in their very hand and soul, allowing them to control and treat the rift and all of its smaller cousins. After barely managing to stabilize the portal with the help of a devout but disaffected agent of the All-Seeing Eye, a Night Caste storyteller and irritant of the former, and a strange old New Moon who believes that all three worlds should live in piece with one another, said witness is made the field leader of a reborn Wild Hunt, using their fame as the so-called Blessed of the Five to happily ignore the grumblings of the remaining Immaculates angry about having to assist an apparent Anathema. Their mission? To find the mysterious sorcerer responsible for the Rift, and possibly end a giant civil war between God-Bloods and a faction of the Wyld Hunt corrupted by a powerful and darkly natured Magical Material before the mysterious malefactor bends the remnants of each side to his will. Along the way, the Blessed picks up, among other people, an idealistic Dragon-Blooded dynast sick of the Realm's politics, a confused demon but good-natured who used to think he was a ghost, and a boisterious Varangian beastman caught between loyalty to his nation and to his corps of mercenaries.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><img itemprop=\"image\" class=\"bbcode-attachment\" src=\"http://imageshack.us/a/img824/1346/mosz.jpg\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" />","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":2}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/180-leliel","name":"Leliel","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar180_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2259"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-12-08T11:10:44-08:00","id":334362,"title":"","content":"Points for the absolute fastest turnaround time from release to Great Marriage.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>&quot;For me, there's no fundamental conflict between really loving something and also seeing it as very profoundly flawed.&quot; -- Jay Eddidin","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2168-chejop-kejak","name":"Chejop Kejak","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar2168_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Feb 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1219"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-12-08T11:11:16-08:00","id":334363,"title":"","content":"That sounds an awful lot like Dragon Age: Inquisition.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><a href=\"http://archiveofourown.org/works/2480852/chapters/5503997\" target=\"_blank\">Glorious Echeladder Ascension Technique</a> - <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/287292-glorious-echeladder-ascension-technique-a-homestuck-exalted-crossover\" target=\"_blank\">Forum Topic</a><br /> <br /> &quot;Look, sometimes you just are in the mood to play the divinely empowered champion of the God of Farts. Mechanically optimized play is not the only way to enjoy playing your character.&quot; -Wise Old Guru","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1048-ryumaru","name":"Ryumaru","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1048_2.png","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"326"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-12-08T12:26:03-08:00","id":334415,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Ryumaru</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/11921-the-great-marriage-of-exalted-and-insert-fandom-here?p=334363#post334363\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">That sounds an awful lot like Dragon Age: Inquisition.</div> </div> </div> </div>Yep. Had to think about how Dorian would fit in.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><img itemprop=\"image\" class=\"bbcode-attachment\" src=\"http://imageshack.us/a/img824/1346/mosz.jpg\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" />","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/180-leliel","name":"Leliel","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar180_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2259"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-12-15T20:37:54-08:00","id":341500,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Sunder the Gold</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/11921-the-great-marriage-of-exalted-and-insert-fandom-here?p=334214#post334214\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Card Captor Sakura.</div> </div> </div> </div>Yep. (Word limit.)","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/476-argonometra","name":"Argonometra","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"534"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-12-17T09:43:46-08:00","id":343056,"title":"","content":"Four young Dynasts, who grow up knowing about how the Realm Defense Grid saved Creation after the Great Contagion, spend their days trying to help others in city around their school in emulation of how Exalts protect the Realm. Eventually, each of them gets dragged into the Wyld via a spatial transference device, and while there, each Exalts - the young optimist and heart of the group becomes a master of hand-to-hand combat, a girl wounded in an earlier accident who masters the use of firewands, an older leader becomes a master swordsman with a Reaver Daiklaive, and her younger sister, who is a singer, becomes the master of a strange set of rope techniques. They are called on occasionally to save the realm from the invading Rakshas and Fair Folk, and are joined by a fifth, who has mastered the Fire Dragon style.<br /> <br /> After one particularly brutal battle, where the girls each found a way to evolve their Essences further, they believe that they have saved Creation, but each is suffering from some damage to their bodies that nothing seems to heal. Their patrons don't seem to think it's a big deal...","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1407-endlesskng","name":"EndlessKng","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"335"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-12-17T12:09:54-08:00","id":343132,"title":"","content":"Yuki Yuna Is A Hero.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>formerly Tornado Wolf, formerly Inugami","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/636-sunder-the-gold","name":"Sunder the Gold","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar636_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"5515"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-12-20T08:50:08-08:00","id":345790,"title":"","content":"Back on the <i>Dragon Age</i> thing...<br /> <br /> I thought about running a game in a tweaked Creation. The reason the Solars fell from power is they sought to enter Heaven and usurp control of it from the Gods. For their hubris, they were cast out of Heaven. The stories the Immaculate Faith tell say that the Solars returned from Heaven as twisted, wretched beings who terrorized the world until they were imprisoned deep within the Earth. The Scarlet Empire is, essentially, Orlais; the Scarlet Empress a historical figure who lived long, long ago and is revered as the Savior of Humanity as it was she who led the united armies of Creation against the twisted Solars and their servants. The reason the Empire is in peril now is, instead, because the Divine (who is the Empress' earthly representative) was recently murdered openly and in full view of powerful and influential members of her court.<br /> <br /> Sidereal Exalted are still Agents of Fate, but they do not live or work in Heaven. Instead they do their work like the Maidens did in pre-history: remotely from Creation.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><div align=\"right\"><span style=\"font-size:28px\"><b><span style=\"color:#000000\"><span style=\"font-family:Verdana\">\u263e</span></span></b></span></div>","edited":{"userid":438,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/438-wulf","user":"wulf","date":". 12-20-2014, 12:44 PM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":2}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/438-wulf","name":"wulf","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar438_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"493"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-12-22T05:58:51-08:00","id":347339,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Gryphon's Feather</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/11921-the-great-marriage-of-exalted-and-insert-fandom-here?p=300249#post300249\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Pandora's tower, that was a good game.<br /> <br /> Edit: Scourge'd.<br /> <br /> A young man becomes a mercenary alongside a childhood friend, seeking silver in battle in a region where most would seek glory. Blaming the local goddess of battle for his farther's death, he seeks her out on the battlefields, and nearly gets himself killed for his trouble, only to be saved by a bemused deathlord. The deathlord offers him a deal, should he accept the the Dusk exaltation she offers, he has a single year to kill the goddess before he must serve her army in the underworld.<br /> <br /> Unable to refuse, he is granted a hecatonchire to guide him, and a single black feather. Should he gather enough death essence, the feather shall become a daiklave capable of permanently slaying the goddess.<br /> <br /> With war looming on the horizon, will he sacrifice those he cares about for a chance at vengeance?</div> </div> </div> </div>Valkyrie Profile! I want to say 'Covenant of the Plume' but it could have been 'Plume of the ... Something' The DS one that went a bit FF tactics.<br /> <br /> 'Feather o'er the battlefield, unto me your power yield!","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1849-suddenthunder","name":"SuddenThunder","avatar":"https://fo