e girl had a tail in spirit form, right? And the ghost transforms into a weapon to fight the evil spirits. Can't remember the name of the anime, though.<br /> <br /> Edit: Noragami","signature":"","edited":{"userid":815,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/815-kazorh","user":"Kazorh","date":". 12-23-2014, 03:58 PM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/815-kazorh","name":"Kazorh","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar815_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"900"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-12-23T15:14:32-08:00","id":348588,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Nightwinder</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/11921-the-great-marriage-of-exalted-and-insert-fandom-here?p=348233#post348233\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">A bumbling Chosen of Journeys manages to accidentally arrange the circumstances for a diminutive beastman to Exalt as a Solar, while trying to fulfill an assignment with the child that the beastman was protecting.<br /> <br /> As they journey around Creation together, they are hounded by a determined southern mortal who believes that the Sidereal will be able to grant him the power of an Exaltation as well, accompanied by his two cohorts, a dim-witted Earth aspect and a cowardly nephwrack.</div> </div> </div> </div>...This is SuperTed, isn't t?","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/561-mockery","name":"Mockery","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar561_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"876"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-12-23T19:28:28-08:00","id":348719,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Mockery</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/11921-the-great-marriage-of-exalted-and-insert-fandom-here?p=348588#post348588\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> ...This is SuperTed, isn't t?</div> </div> </div> </div><br /> It totally is SuperTed.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/649-nightwinder","name":"Nightwinder","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"154"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-12-24T18:18:33-08:00","id":349437,"title":"","content":"A revered Zenith of the First Age exhausts her Essence in battle, and seals herself in a statue to recover. She slumbers throughout centuries, eventually woken by a similarly frail wood spirit. The spirit tells her that demons have conquered the land, and beseeches her for aid.<br /> However, the Creation she returns to is a strange one- devoid of belief, of technology, and of her Solar kin. With the few powers left to her- and the guidance of her long-lost Lunar mate- the Zenith spreads the glory of the Sun.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/476-argonometra","name":"Argonometra","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"534"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-12-24T21:01:54-08:00","id":349524,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Argonometra</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/11921-the-great-marriage-of-exalted-and-insert-fandom-here?p=349437#post349437\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">A revered Zenith of the First Age exhausts her Essence in battle, and seals herself in a statue to recover. She slumbers throughout centuries, eventually woken by a similarly frail wood spirit. The spirit tells her that demons have conquered the land, and beseeches her for aid.<br /> However, the Creation she returns to is a strange one- devoid of belief, of technology, and of her Solar kin. With the few powers left to her- and the guidance of her long-lost Lunar mate- the Zenith spreads the glory of the Sun.</div> </div> </div> </div>And also, is a dog. Can't forget to mention that.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>&quot;For me, there's no fundamental conflict between really loving something and also seeing it as very profoundly flawed.&quot; -- Jay Eddidin","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2168-chejop-kejak","name":"Chejop Kejak","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar2168_2.png","title":"Member","rank"