/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar636_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"5515"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-12-24T21:54:43-08:00","id":349544,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Sunder the Gold</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/11921-the-great-marriage-of-exalted-and-insert-fandom-here?p=349542#post349542\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Pretty sure he meant Wakka.</div> </div> </div> </div>Huh. That would make <i>much </i> more sense.<br /> <br /> Slightly less funny though ...","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1849-suddenthunder","name":"SuddenThunder","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1849_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"563"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-12-24T23:54:05-08:00","id":349645,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Chejop Kejak</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/11921-the-great-marriage-of-exalted-and-insert-fandom-here?p=349524#post349524\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">And also, is a dog. Can't forget to mention that.</div> </div> </div> </div>Are <i>you</i> merely an ape? No? I thought so.<br /> <br /> <div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Sunder the Gold</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/11921-the-great-marriage-of-exalted-and-insert-fandom-here?p=349542#post349542\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Pretty sure he meant Wakka.</div> </div> </div> </div>Indeed, although Waka is equally useless- if not more so.<br /> <br /> I always saw Issun as a minor god of calligraphy. Like that cricket in <i>Mulan.</i>","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/476-argonometra","name":"Argonometra","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"534"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-12-25T21:21:56-08:00","id":350378,"title":"","content":"Stories across Creation whisper of the Green Sun Princes. Murdering our kin, our children. Butchering our towns. Enslaving all they come across. Eating our flesh. Whispers of rape and a soul twisted by evil. These nigh-mythical beings in green flame, representing all the sins of mortals.<br /> <br /> But what are they, who are they? Do they dream? Do they have their own demons that represent everything they despise and fear?<br /> <br /> This is their story. The world through their eyes...<br /> <br /> (Not perfect, but I think it's at least clear what this is linked to)","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Discord: HalfTangible#7505<br /> &quot;+3 Girlfriend is totally unoptimized. You are better off with a +1 Keen Witty girlfriend and then appling Greater Magic Make-up to increase her enhancement bonus.&quot; -Keld Danar on <a href=\"https://forums.giantitp.com/showthread.php?p=10856903#post10856903\" target=\"_blank\">GitP Forums</a><br /> Playing Peleps Raptor, Fire Aspect playboy in the Grand Tour","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/879-halftangible","name":"HalfTangible","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar879_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"366"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-12-25T22:07:44-08:00","id":350404,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>HalfTangible</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/11921-the-great-marriage-of-exalted-and-insert-fandom-here?p=350378#post350378\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Stories across Creation whisper of the Green Sun Princes. Murdering our kin, our children. Butchering our towns. Enslaving all they come across. Eating our flesh. Whispers of rape and a soul twisted by evil. These nigh-mythical beings in green flame, representing all the sins of mortals.<br /> <br /> But what are they, who are they? Do they dream? Do they have their own demons that represent everything they despise and fear?<br /> <br /> This is their story. The world through their eyes...<br /> <br /> (Not perfect, but I think it's at least clear what this is linked to)</div> </div> </div> </div>Ah ha! I knew I remembered that whole &quot;murdering our kin butchering our towns&quot; bit from somewhere. Bonus points for using the text from the prologue: this is the webcomic Drowtales.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/815-kazorh","name":"Kazorh","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar815_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"900"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-12-26T06:43:40-08:00","id":350631,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Kazorh</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/11921-the-great-marriage-of-exalted-and-insert-fandom-here?p=350404#post350404\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> Ah ha! I knew I remembered that whole &quot;murdering our kin butchering our towns&quot; bit from somewhere. Bonus points for using the text from the prologue: this is the webcomic Drowtales.</div> </div> </div> </div>I had it open in the next tab the whole time.<br /> <br /> I REALLY wanted to do it as Abyssals so i could change 'whispering of incest' to 'rumors of blades forged from souls driven mad' or something similar.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Discord: HalfTangible#7505<br /> &quot;+3 Girlfriend is totally unoptimized. You are better off with a +1 Keen Witty girlfriend and then appling Greater Magic Make-up to increase her enhancement bonus.&quot; -Keld Danar on <a href=\"https://forums.giantitp.com/showthread.php?p=10856903#post10856903\" target=\"_blank\">GitP Forums</a><br /> Playing Peleps Raptor, Fire Aspect playboy in the Grand Tour","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/879-halftangible","name":"HalfTangible","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar879_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"366"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-12-31T05:06:15-08:00","id":355677,"title":"","content":"The Realm has been torn asunder by civil war. In a desperate attempt to bring peace, the Sidereals form a new corps from the Roseblack's elite: an aerial legion mounted on lesser elemental dragons.<br /> The protagonist, a Lost Egg who serves in her navy, is unexpectedly drafted into this legion.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/476-argonometra","name":"Argonometra","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"534"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-01-19T17:14:25-08:00","id":375697,"title":"","content":"Three young girls from the blessed isle become exigents when they receive a vision of a goddess who wishes them to save the land she oversees. Upon arriving, they are told that the goddess has is held captive by her own high priest, and are sent to retrieve the artifacts they'll need to defeat him.<br /> <br /> But is that really the reason they were granted their exigences?<br />","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><b>Currently Playing:</b> <i>A large, mixed splat game of <b>CofD</b>.</i> <b>As:</b> Seraph du Salomon, Voice on the concordance. Unsubtle man reluctantly participating in the business of Magi. Awakening 2E homebrew <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/mage-the-awakening/1338514-house-du-salomon-a-proximus-dynasty?_=1569864567692\" target=\"_blank\">http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/m...=1569864567692</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2598-gryphon-s-feather","name":"Gryphon's Feather","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar2598_3.png","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Mar 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"215"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-01-19T20:59:07-08:00","id":375862,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Gryphon's Feather</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/11921-the-great-marriage-of-exalted-and-insert-fandom-here?p=375697#post375697\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Three young girls from the blessed isle become exigents when they receive a vision of a goddess who wishes them to save the land she oversees. Upon arriving, they are told that the goddess has is held captive by her own high priest, and are sent to retrieve the artifacts they'll need to defeat him.<br /> <br /> But is that really the reason they were granted their exigences?</div> </div> </div> </div><br /> That would be Magic Knights Rayearth, yes?","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/561-mockery","name":"Mockery","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar561_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"876"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-01-20T11:41:03-08:00","id":376471,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Rater202</strong> </div> <div class=\"message\">Five Children are drawn into the World Body of a strange Titan at the beckoning of one of it's three Third Circle Souls-One of her brothers has been corrupted by a mysterious force and has gone mad-he's imprisoned her and grievously injured the third member of their trinity. The Children are tasked with traveling the world body and finding the hidden objects containing Pseudo-Exigencies based on the powers of 10 of the other Third Circle Souls of the Titan and using their power to defeat the Corrupted Deva and cleanse the Titans world body and other Devas. However, The Corrupted Deva has obtained five of those Exaltations and used their power to create powerful demons to enact his will, and There's evidence that something else is pulling strings...</div> </div> </div> </div>... this sounds suspiciously like Digimon Frontier.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><a href=\"http://archiveofourown.org/works/2480852/chapters/5503997\" target=\"_blank\">Glorious Echeladder Ascension Technique</a> - <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/287292-glorious-echeladder-ascension-technique-a-homestuck-exalted-crossover\" target=\"_blank\">Forum Topic</a><br /> <br /> &quot;Look, sometimes you just are in the mood to play the divinely empowered champion of the God of Farts. Mechanically optimized play is not the only way to enjoy playing your character.&quot; -Wise Old Guru","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"