 on an undercover mission to expose an Abyssal plot to murder the world, it turns out that Nexus boy is the Oracle's next incarnation. The two newest Sidereals and their Chosen of Serenity trainer end up foiling the Abyssal and saving creation.<br /> </div></div> </div> </div><br /> <br /> Hardest part was choosing castes for everyone.</div> </div> </div> </div>Thank you. And yes, Galahad is definitely a Chosen of Secrets. <img src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/smilies/smile.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" title=\"Smile\" smilieid=\"1\" class=\"inlineimg\" /><br /> <br /> <div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Gaius</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/11921-the-great-marriage-of-exalted-and-insert-fandom-here?p=429342#post429342\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> Based on a passing awareness of the movie alone, I shall take a shot in the dark for: &quot;Jupiter Ascending.&quot;</div> </div> </div> </div>Quite right.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/476-argonometra","name":"Argonometra","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"534"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-03-06T12:48:05-08:00","id":430518,"title":"","content":"A Dynast head of a minor house is appointed by the Empress herself to rule over a Satrap in the far South. While the area is nothing but desert wasteland, it is the only known source of a rare type of demense, which can be mined for an edible form of Essence that can boost the power of any Exalt who consumes it. Roughly a year after becoming the ruler of the satrapy, a traitor in the Dynast's household betrays the lord to House Cynis, who kill the lord and become the new rulers of the desert satrapy. The only survivors of the minor house are the Dragon-Blooded's Sidereal wife and his mortal son, who is the result of Sidereal breeding experiments with the Dragon-Blooded since the end of the First Age. While in the desert, the son Exalts into an Eclipse caste. The combination of his Sidereal-guided bloodline, the Solar Exaltation and the edible Essence in the satrap has given the son powerful Awareness and Investigation charms, opening a window to the Loom of Fate within his very mind and allowing him to see countless threads into the future. After a few days in the desert, the two Exalts are found by the satrap's natives: a tribe of fearless nomadic warriors capable of riding the great behemoths that occupy the desert. The Eclipse uses his unique vision and his Exalted abilities to become part of the nomad's tribe, their leader and eventually their messiah, all on the path to destroying House Cynis and taking back the rulership of the Satrapy for himself.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>&quot;Oh boys! Look what I got here!&quot;<br /> &quot;Hey, where the Dynast women at?&quot;","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/814-dreamking89","name":"dreamking89","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"237"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-03-06T13:10:24-08:00","id":430529,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by