th.com/member/561-mockery","name":"Mockery","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar561_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"876"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-03-18T09:07:51-07:00","id":447753,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Argonometra</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/11921-the-great-marriage-of-exalted-and-insert-fandom-here?p=349437#post349437\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">A revered Zenith of the First Age exhausts her Essence in battle, and seals herself in a statue to recover. She slumbers throughout centuries, eventually woken by a similarly frail wood spirit. The spirit tells her that demons have conquered the land, and beseeches her for aid.<br /> However, the Creation she returns to is a strange one- devoid of belief, of technology, and of her Solar kin. With the few powers left to her- and the guidance of her long-lost Lunar mate- the Zenith spreads the glory of the Sun.</div> </div> </div> </div><br /> As a side note, I know other people have gone through and answered this one--apparently correctly--but it took me more than one readthrough as I went back over this topic to realize that it couldn't be ActRaiser.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/561-mockery","name":"Mockery","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar561_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"876"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-03-18T17:25:22-07:00","id":448520,"title":"","content":"Mourning the loss of her Zenith true love, a young war hero is trying (not very successfully) to adapt to peacetime life. Despite the integral role she played in defeating the forces of the mad Infernal who rallied half the world against her nation, she is looked down upon and derided by her comrades, certain that she attained her status only through her lover's influence and not her own considerable skill. When an old friend, framed for treason, approaches her and offers a chance to clear his name and make her own, she jumps at the call, Exalting as a Night caste in the process. She must navigate the schemes of revenge-driven Moonshadow and his spider-totem Lunar mate in order to clear her friend's name, and save the lives of everyone in the Imperial City.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1419-wardragon","name":"WarDragon","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1419_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1052"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-03-18T20:38:11-07:00","id":448776,"title":"","content":"Agent Carter, which is an awesome show! I need to finish watching the season.<br /> <br /> A young Infernal is opening living in the Imperial City and trying to overcome his dark impulses to use his power to help mortals. The Solar Deliberate has a Chosen of Ending watching over him, with orders to execute him, should the Infernal step out of line. While investigating a murder that used magic as the weapon, the Infernal discovers a plot involving another Infernal and a Sorcererous narcotic. The Infernal stops the plot and ends up clearing his name.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>I write things.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/3950-wonderandawe","name":"wonderandawe","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar3950_2.gif","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Sep 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"5410"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-03-18T21:06:26-07:00","id":448805,"title":"","content":"Is that Storm Front, book 1 of the Dresden Files? Not quite how I'd peg Harry, but he is a hard one to place...","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1419-wardragon","name":"WarDragon","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1419_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1052"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-03-19T05:46:50-07:00","id":449026,"title":"","content":"Yes. I had Harry as a Solar, but then changed it to Infernal. Makes sense with his relationship with the white council.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>I write things.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/3950-wonderandawe","name":"wonderandawe","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar3950_2.gif","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Sep 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"5410"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-03-19T16:22:54-07:00","id":449883,"title":"","content":"Yeah, Infernal is good enough for him. Lunar and DB work as well.<br /> <br /> <br /> It is the Modern Age of Creation, and the Exalted exist only in myth and fiction. Gods and monsters have been banished to the edge of the world for so long that no one believes that they ever existed at all. One day, it all changes; a new star appears in the sky, burning by day and night, and with it, men and women awaken to strange powers. The more they use their gifts, the more these new Exalted, no matter their stripe, grow to hold normal humanity in contempt, as things to be ruled over and abused. There is human resistance, but the awesome Charms of the Exalted prove too powerful for even the mightiest of weapons to fight, and soon, all governments capitulate.<br /> <br /> The greatest and maddest of the Solars dwells in Crane's Nest, with half the city transmuted to solid steel by his trademark sorcery, and the sun blotted out by his Fiend lieutenant. One of the few remaining rebel groups stumble across a young man who witnessed the Steel Solar on the day of his takeover. The Solar killed the boy's father, and the boy became the only person to have ever escaped his wrath... the only person living to have a clue to his Flaw of Invulnerability. Will he live to take his vengeance, or be yet another casualty of man's subjugation?","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1419-wardragon","name":"WarDragon","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1419_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1052"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-03-19T17:03:55-07:00","id":449904,"title":"","content":"A princess of a kingdom is forced to flee from a life of luxury when her father, the king, is killed by her cousin, who usurps. Accompanied by her bodyguard, she is pursued by the palace guards, and eventually cornered on top of a high cliff. In the resulting struggle, she Exalts as a Zenith Caste just before she and her bodyguard fall off the cliff, and he Exalts as a Dawn Caste. Now, they seek the four Exigents who helped establish the kingdom in ages long past. <br /> <br /> /doesn't think I described this one well, but let's see","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1596-horngeek","name":"horngeek","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1596_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"241"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-03-19T20:08:10-07:00","id":450060,"title":"","content":"@WarDragon: Steelheart, by Brandon Sanderson. Which I really need to read.<br /> <br /> @horngeek: Yona of the Dawn. Never watched it, I just remembered what you said about it in that other thread. :P","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/815-kazorh","name":"Kazorh","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar815_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"900"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-03-19T20:26:14-07:00","id":450067,"title":"","content":"Correct! Good guess for someone who hasn't read it.:P","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1419-wardragon","name":"WarDragon","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1419_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1052"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-03-19T21:08:10-07:00","id":450098,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Kazorh</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/11921-the-great-marriage-of-exalted-and-insert-fandom-here?p=450060#post450060\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">@horngeek: Yona of the Dawn. Never watched it, I just remembered what you said about it in that other thread. :P</div> </div> </div> </div>Correct! :P<br />","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1596-horngeek","name":"horngeek","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1596_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"241"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-03-20T03:51:53-07:00","id":450283,"title":"","content":"An Infernal warlord and his Zenith archenemy are sucked into a mysterious portal.<br /> They emerge in a very different world. A world where technology holds sway over magic and nature. A world whose mortals fear deadlines more than demons.<br /> Unfortunately, the Exalts' Shards have been severely reduced by the transition, forcing them to navigate this new world without Charms or sorcery-- to take on menial jobs more suited to peasants. Even so, they retain the honor and determination that made them heroes...which is good, because Creation's inhabitants are hatching a plot that threatens <i>both</i> worlds...<br /> <br /> <div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>wonderandawe</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/11921-the-great-marriage-of-exalted-and-insert-fandom-here?p=449026#post449026\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Yes. I had Harry as a Solar, but then changed it to Infernal. Makes sense with his relationship with the white council.</div> </div> </div> </div>The White Council aren't exactly paragons of morality themselves.<br /> <br /> *resists urge to make a DF crossover thread*","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/476-argonometra","name":"Argonometra","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"534"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-03-20T04:22:49-07:00","id":450295,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Argonometra</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/11921-the-great-marriage-of-exalted-and-insert-fandom-here?p=450283#post450283\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">An Infernal warlord and his Zenith archenemy are sucked into a mysterious portal.<br /> They emerge in a very different world. A world where technology holds sway over magic and nature. A world whose mortals fear deadlines more than demons.<br /> Unfortunately, the Exalts' Shards have been severely reduced by the transition, forcing them to navigate this new world without Charms or sorcery-- to take on menial jobs more suited to peasants. Even so, they retain the honor and determination that made them heroes...which is good, because Creation's inhabitants are hatching a plot that threatens <i>both</i> worlds...</div> </div> </div> </div>Is it <i>Hataraku Maou-Sama! (Demon Lord at Work!)</i> ?<br />","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/487-greyman","name":"Greyman","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar487_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1308"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-03-20T18:56:58-07:00","id":451176,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Greyman</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/11921-the-great-marriage-of-exalted-and-insert-fandom-here?p=450295#post450295\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Is it <i>Hataraku Maou-Sama! (Demon Lord at Work!)</i> ?</div> </div> </div> </div>Yep.<br /> -<br /> Within the South, there is a walled city. A city of gleaming white towers and concrete angles. A city that is watched, every hour of every day, by omnipresent cameras. The slightest deviation from order is punished with torture and death.<br /> But there are those who live outside the law. Most famous- and most feared- of these are the Sidereals. They are the last free channel of communication, the city's only hope for change.<br /> Our protagonist is a Chosen of Journeys whose sister has been framed for murder.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/476-argonometra","name":"Argonometra"