"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-05-16T22:14:59-07:00","id":516758,"title":"","content":"In the wake of an invasion by the Autocthonians, in the ruined remains of the South, an old Night, trying to ignore both the living and the dead who follow him, is captured by the vicious warriors of a brutal Dawn warlord who claims to be more than a god even as the blacktog ravages his body, forcing him to turn to an Artifact to supply him with pure elements. Recognizing the purity of his Essence-infused blood, the warlord assigns him to a deranged and yet pitiable Terrestrial as a living medicinal kit for wounds sustained in the tyranny of scavenged-warstrider warfare, sent as part of a retrieval party for his general, a Djala Full Moon who absconded with a quick and resilient siege walker along with the warlord's God-Blooded &quot;brides&quot;, seeking the fertile remains of her homeland. The Night escapes with her help, and reluctantly agrees to assist her cause and escort the walker from the legion of Void-twisted calvary brainwashed by the warlord.<br /> <br /> It's going to be a long chase.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><img itemprop=\"image\" class=\"bbcode-attachment\" src=\"http://imageshack.us/a/img824/1346/mosz.jpg\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" />","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/180-leliel","name":"Leliel","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar180_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2259"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-05-16T23:21:10-07:00","id":516782,"title":"","content":"Time to get <i>really </i>obscure!<img src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/smilies/cool.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" title=\"Cool\" smilieid=\"6\" class=\"inlineimg\" /><br /> <br /> There is a kingdom in the Threshold where a Prince has usurped the throne; his sister, the Princess, exalts as a Solar and flees into enchanted woods, where she raises an army of ancient automatons and rebel peasants with the sheer force of her charisma (and her slowly returning ancient memories). Meanwhile, a young Changing Moon thief and his 1st Circle demon friend aid a young orphan girl who has exalted as a Twilight, while evading the pursuit of an Abyssal woman, who turns out to be the sister of the Twilight, who she slays in every incarnation (the young girl is actually a past incarnation of the Princess, sent forward in time by the machinations of an immensely powerful First Age Twilight, who hides his true abilities behind a mask of harmless madness).<br /> <br /> I defy <b>anyone</b> to know what this is from!!<img src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/smilies/wink.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" title=\"Wink\" smilieid=\"4\" class=\"inlineimg\" />","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/681-hand-of-omega","name":"Hand-of-Omega","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar681_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2747"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-05-18T20:14:04-07:00","id":518767,"title":"","content":"No takers? Then, I guess:<br /> <br /> <img src=\"http://www.quickmeme.com/img/a6/a6d59eba7cf1de431caa3d580dab31bd17d64532b085c44064e8505f87ab7fcd.jpg\" class=\"bbcode-attachment bbcode-attachment--lightbox js-lightbox\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" itemprop=\"image\" loading=\"lazy\"/><br /> <br /> <img src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/smilies/cool.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" title=\"Cool\" smilieid=\"6\" class=\"inlineimg\" /><img src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/smilies/tongue.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" title=\"Stick Out Tongue\" smilieid=\"5\" class=\"inlineimg\" /><img src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/smilies/wink.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" title=\"Wink\" smilieid=\"4\" class=\"inlineimg\" />","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/681-hand-of-omega","name":"Hand-of-Omega","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar681_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2747"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-05-18T20:15:22-07:00","id":518773,"title":"","content":"So what is it?","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2034-jaytee","name":"JayTee","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar2034_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jan 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1805"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-05-18T20:28:08-07:00","id":518794,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Hand-of-Omega, after a little over 24 hours</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/11921-the-great-marriage-of-exalted-and-insert-fandom-here?p=518767#post518767\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">No takers? Then, I guess:<br /> <br /> [I Win.jpg]<br /> <br /> <img src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/smilies/cool.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" title=\"Cool\" smilieid=\"6\" class=\"inlineimg\" /><img src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/smilies/tongue.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" title=\"Stick Out Tongue\" smilieid=\"5\" class=\"inlineimg\" /><img src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/smilies/wink.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" title=\"Wink\" smilieid=\"4\" class=\"inlineimg\" /></div> </div> </div> </div>*Ahem*<br /> <br /> <div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Me, a little under a year ago</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/11921-the-great-marriage-of-exalted-and-insert-fandom-here?p=149869#post149869\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Project Razor is not a new thing. Autochthonia made its bridge to Creation centuries, but it was too little, too late. The habitable parts of the pole of metal are largely gone, and most of the people who once inhabited the Maker are gone with it. But a single metropolis hurled itself toward the core--the least corrupted part of the Great Maker--and has remained there, waiting out the long death of Autochthon. It's been so long, in fact, that the people of this city no longer remember Creation, Now, though, the Maker's death is imminent. Thinking themselves having escaped the death of their world, the larger populace does nothing; only the youth of the city delve into ancient charms and structures to create a new Champion, the Moonsilver Caste <i>Ark of the New Dawn</i>. Charged with seeking out other survivors, others who might be able to save their dying city and dying world, <i>Ark's</i> journeys lead her to Creation, where she encounters a pair of mortals and a formerly enslaved Bronze Tiger. She's sure the people from this world can save hers, but the journey back is long, and others along the way won't make it any easier.</div> </div> </div> </div>Bring it.<br /> <br /> EDIT: Also, my Google-fu suggests your entry is Thieves &amp; Kings.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":561,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/561-mockery","user":"Mockery","date":". 05-19-2015, 09:09 AM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/561-mockery","name":"Mockery","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar561_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"876"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-05-24T22:21:56-07:00","id":527356,"title":"","content":"A heretic guild of sorcerers went too far with their demonic alchemy. In their arrogance, they created parasitical crystals connected to the world of Malfeas and experimented with implanting them into the bodies of other human beings. These crystals would grow and spread across the host's body, symptomatically turning their skin into beautiful, living works of stained-glass.<br /> <br /> Only two test subjects are known to have survived; the original host, who was reborn as an Air Aspect Dragon-Blood and turned his demonic and Exalted strength against his creators, destroying them all but one of them. His best friend, a mortal sorcerer-scholar, survived by virtue of having already left the guild in protest of their dark designs.<br /> <br /> But the vengeful Child of Mela was not the only survivor. A young girl, taken in by the guild as an orphan and taught the arts of sorcerous craftsmanship, likewise survived by the grace of the Dragons, taking the Second Breath as a Child of Pasiap. However, she would sleep for another 10 years as the sorcerous curse took hold of her body.<br /> <br /> Filled with pity for his fellow victim, the Air Aspect bent his powers into a blasphemous working, summoning the stuff of Hell itself to create a castle where he and she might have a place to live in peace. One by one, he began to summon forth demons from the Infernal Realm to staff and guard his mighty fortress.<br /> <br /> But the stained-glass curse, demonic in nature, reacted to the growing number of demons. The more with which he surrounded himself, the faster his disease spread, and the more he lost his mind.<br /> <br /> By the time the young Princess of the Earth finally awakes from her sickness-sleep, her ally has forgotten his original purpose. As she struggles to understand the changes that have befallen her, he plots how he might persuade her to join him in unleashing the forces of Malfeas upon Creation and all humanity.<br /> <br /> <br /> This isn't a work that's actually finished yet, but you should go learn about <b><i><a href=\"https://www.kickstarter.com/projects/iga/bloodstained-ritual-of-the-night\" target=\"_blank\">Bloodstained</a></i></b>. There only 18 days left (as of this posting) to contribute and make Koji Igarashi's next videogame all it can be, to carry on the spiritual tradition of his <i>Castlevania </i>games.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>formerly Tornado Wolf, formerly Inugami","edited":{"userid":636,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/636-sunder-the-gold","user":"Sunder the Gold","date":". 06-12-2015, 05:42 PM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/636-sunder-the-gold","name":"Sunder the Gold","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar636_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"5515"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-05-24T23:14:38-07:00","id":527374,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Orig