ng Creatures to fall and invade creation. While one of the thaumaturgist engineers is exalted as a dawn caste and carrying an armour relic. His only clue about this mysterious sideral are the following words &quot;Prepare For Interesting Times&quot;","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Forum's Official's Joker and Trickster. Pardon my bad english, aint my first language (I Speak Spanish).<br /> ST: DtF, HtR, WtO, MtA<br /> Signature Chars: Crowley (hakalu), Joe The Nuwisha (WtA)<br /> Changelings: be afraid of the Technocracian High Five of Doom","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1754-crowley","name":"Crowley","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1754_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1639"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-05-25T06:29:33-07:00","id":527602,"title":"","content":"Is that Half-Life?","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/815-kazorh","name":"Kazorh","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar815_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"900"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-05-25T06:47:23-07:00","id":527622,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Kazorh</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/11921-the-great-marriage-of-exalted-and-insert-fandom-here?p=527602#post527602\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Is that Half-Life?</div> </div> </div> </div>We got a winner!","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Forum's Official's Joker and Trickster. Pardon my bad english, aint my first language (I Speak Spanish).<br /> ST: DtF, HtR, WtO, MtA<br /> Signature Chars: Crowley (hakalu), Joe The Nuwisha (WtA)<br /> Changelings: be afraid of the Technocracian High Five of Doom","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1754-crowley","name":"Crowley","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1754_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1639"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-06-04T16:59:41-07:00","id":540171,"title":"","content":"During the height of the First Age, young Exalts fend off boredom through dangerous sports- one of which is the illicit racing of lesser elemental dragons. A young stablehand, recently Exalted as a Dawn, aims to become a champion racer. He navigates the Blessed Isle's racetracks- its deadly, Essence-powered obstacles and brutal fellow competitors- trying to fulfil this dream...and stumbles into a prophecy or two along the way. After all, <i>Solar.</i>","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/476-argonometra","name":"Argonometra","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"534"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-06-07T03:57:25-07:00","id":543702,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Saur Ops Specialist</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/11921-the-great-marriage-of-exalted-and-insert-fandom-here?p=527374#post527374\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">But... that isn't how the thread game works! You don't tell people! You've ruined it! (^VVVVVVVV^)</div> </div> </div> </div>Speaking of, I just found this novel called <i>Starborn</i> that sounds relevant to Exalted:<br /> <i>...when an unnatural storm targets her superstitious community, Kyndra is blamed. She fears for her life until two strangers save her, by wielding powers not seen for an age - powers fuelled by the sun and the moon.</i><br /> So yeah, Sidereal.<br />","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/476-argonometra","name":"Argonometra","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"534"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-06-12T12:15:22-07:00","id":551965,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Leliel</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/11921-the-great-marriage-of-exalted-and-insert-fandom-here?p=516758#post516758\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">In the wake of an invasion by the Autocthonians, in the ruined remains of the South, an old Night, trying to ignore both the living and the dead who follow him, is captured by the vicious warriors of a brutal Dawn warlord who claims to be more than a god even as the blacktog ravages his body, forcing him to turn to an Artifact to supply him with pure elements. Recognizing the purity of his Essence-infused blood, the warlord assigns him to a deranged and yet pitiable Terrestrial as a living medicinal kit for wounds sustained in the tyranny of scavenged-warstrider warfare, sent as part of a retrieval party for his general, a Djala Full Moon who absconded with a quick and resilient siege walker along with the warlord's God-Blooded &quot;brides&quot;, seeking the fertile remains of her homeland. The Night escapes with her help, and reluctantly agrees to assist her cause and escort the walker from the legion of Void-twisted calvary brainwashed by the warlord.<br /> <br /> It's going to be a long chase.</div> </div> </div> </div>I kinda love that everyone seems to have found this so obvious, they didn't even bother to type it out. But I do know what it is, so WITNESS ME!<br /> <br /> (Dunno about your assignment of splats, though - he's the one who's all feral and seemingly-indestructible, whilst she's making bargains and inspiring helpless people to action, so I'd swap the Lunar-Solar bit.)<br /> <br /> I've been out for a while, and don't feel up to a long entry just now. Hopefully, this should prove (barely) recognizable:<br /> <br /> <br /> In a small Outcast-ruled kingdom in the North, the unExalted son of the dead king broods on his place in the world, until an Abyssal Exaltation strikes him.<br /> <br /> He then sets off to channel the vengeance of the dead into reclaiming his kingdom. The Whispers he faces will lead him to destroy his childhood friends, his fiancee, and even his mother - ultimately leaving a kingdom of the dead with few, not even the Abyssal Prince himself - to witness what comes after.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>&quot;For me, there's no fundamental conflict between really loving something and also seeing it as very profoundly flawed.&quot; -- Jay Eddidin","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2168-chejop-kejak","name":"Chejop Kejak","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar2168_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Feb 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1219"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-06-12T15:13:48-07:00","id":552237,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Chejop Kejak</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/11921-the-great-marriage-of-exalted-and-insert-fandom-here?p=551965#post551965\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> In a small Outcast-ruled kingdom in the North, the unExalted son of the dead king broods on his place in the world, until an Abyssal Exaltation strikes him.<br /> <br /> He then sets off to channel the vengeance of the dead into reclaiming his kingdom. The Whispers he faces will lead him to destroy his childhood friends, his fiancee, and even his mother - ultimately leaving a kingdom of the dead with few, not even the Abyssal Prince himself - to witness what comes after.</div> </div> </div> </div>... Is this Hamlet?","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/561-mockery","name":"Mockery","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar561_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"876"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-06-14T17:31:41-07:00","id":555037,"title":"","content":"ok, im STILL learning from exalted so...<br /> <br /> The War against the kingdoms continue...The War has never changed.<br /> One of the Colones of the DB has gone missing and some believe he has withdraw in insanity due all the things he seen since his outpost was too close to the Chaos Borders.<br /> A young DB is sent during this times of war to find this Colonel -using the war as a screen cover-. in order to find Colonel who has started a cult of violence.<br /> Followed by other young three promising dragon blooded in this area of the Scavenger lands. Where Death and madness are one as the constant battles between lookshy and the tribes continue, Soon learning that War is Hell... and its the hell of the mind.<br /> <br /> Colonel Kun-tse Has to die.<br /> ....The Horror...The Horror...Exterminate All Them Brutes.<br />","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Forum's Official's Joker and Trickster. Pardon my bad english, aint my first language (I Speak Spanish).<br /> ST: DtF, HtR, WtO, MtA<br /> Signature Chars: Crowley (hakalu), Joe The Nuwisha (WtA)<br /> Changelings: be afraid of the Technocracian High Five of Doom","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1754-crowley","name":"Crowley","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1754_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1639"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-06-14T21:05:30-07:00","id":555255,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Crowley</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/11921-the-great-marriage-of-exalted-and-insert-fandom-here?p=555037#post555037\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">ok, im STILL learning from exalted so...<br /> <br /> The War against the kingdoms continue...The War has never changed.<br /> One of the Colones of the DB has gone missing and some believe he has withdraw in insanity due all the things he seen since his outpost was too close to the Chaos Borders.<br /> A young DB is sent during this times of war to find this Colonel -using the war as a screen cover-. in order to find Colonel who has started a cult of violence.<br /> Followed by other young three promising dragon blooded in this area of the Scavenger lands. Where Death and madness are one as the constant battles between lookshy and the tribes continue, Soon learning that War is Hell... and its the hell of the mind.<br /> <br /> Colonel Kun-tse Has to die.<br /> ....The Horror...The Horror...Exterminate All Them Brutes.</div> </div> </div> </div>Heart of Darkness.<br /> <br /> Edit: Given the Realm, the rank would be a dragonlord rather than colonel.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/23-saur-ops-specialist","name":"Saur Ops Specialist","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar23_3.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"9371"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-06-19T23:06:32-07:00","id":561615,"title":"","content":"I got a good one:<br /> <br /> An adventurous Twilight Caste scavenger lord has followed the path of his father to an ancient set of ruins deep in the East. With the help of the elder from the nearby village, he enters the ruins only to find that they are far larger than they appear to be from the outside and show references to cultures not only from the Scavanger Lands, but from all over Creation. The ruins are also occupied by various demons, all lorded over by 8 Third Circle Demons. As he explores the ruins further, he learns the entrance to the ruins was actually a gateway to Malfeas, and the ruins are the body of an ancient Yozi, one who assisted Gaia in designing life in Creation. Using the ancient secrets of the temple, the Twilight must find the Primary Soul of this Yozi and properly banish it to Malfeas.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>&quot;Oh boys! Look what I got here!&quot;<br /> &quot;Hey, where the Dynast women at?&quot;","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/814-dreamking89","name":"dreamking89","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"237"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-07-04T12:46:14-07:00","id":579079,"title":"","content":"I'm not very familiar with this one's lore, so it might not be exact. Just thought it'd be cool to try.<br /> <br /> ---<br /> <br /> In a time before the first age was forged a Daiklave of such unstoppable might that even the Primordials could not stand against it. As the blade was used in countless battles against first the Primordials, then other exalted, then other mortals, a dark fire began to burn within the blade until it gained a will of its own. This will wanted nothing more than to kill and slaughter, and so it cut a bloody swath across the world, consuming the souls of all who stood against it.<br /> <br /> The evil sword was shattered in the Usurpation, and its pieces scattered. But the sword itself could not be destroyed entirely. It was sealed away, but eventually was found but a pirate of the west. The blade hatched upon a plan: to find the perfect warrior and posses them, granting them the skill of all of its previous wielders and becoming unstoppable.<br /> <br /> However, there is one weapon that can defeat even this mighty blade: forged from one of its lost shards and blessed by the Unconquered Sun, it requires only a warrior with the caliber to wield it.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Discord: HalfTangible#7505<br /> &quot;+3 Girlfriend is totally unoptimized. You are better off with a +1 Keen Witty girlfriend and then appling Greater Magic Make-up to increase her enhancement bonus.&quot; -Keld Danar on <a href=\"https://forums.giantitp.com/showthread.php?p=10856903#post10856903\" target=\"_blank\">GitP Forums</a><br /> Playing Peleps Raptor, Fire Aspect playboy in the Grand Tour","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/879-halftangible","name":"HalfTangible","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar879_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"366"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-07-04T17:31:17-07:00","id":579291,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>HalfTangible</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/11921-the-great-marriage-of-exalted-and-insert-fandom-here?p=579079#post579079\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">I'm not very familiar with this one's lore, so it might not be exact. Just thought it'd be cool to try.<br /> <br /> ---<br /> <br /> In a time before the first age was forged a Daiklave of such unstoppable might that even the Primordials could not stand against it. As the blade was used in countless battles against first the Primordials, then other exalted, then other mortals, a dark fire began to burn within the blade until it gained a will of its own. This will wanted nothing more than to kill and slaughter, and so it cut a bloody swath across the world, consuming the souls of all who stood against it.<br /> <br /> The evil sword was shattered in the Usurpation, and its pieces scattered. But the sword itself could not be destroyed entirely. It was sealed away, but eventually was found but a pirate of the west. The blade hatched upon a plan: to find the perfect warrior and posses them, granting them the skill of all of its previous wielders and becoming unstoppable.<br /> <br /> However, there is one weapon that can defeat even this mighty blade: forged from one of its lost shards and blessed by the Unconquered Sun, it requires only a warrior with the caliber to wield it.</div> </div> </div> </div><a href=\"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=Yxrpyv8SNS4\" target=\"_blank\">Transcending history and the world, a tale of souls and swords, eternally retold...</a>","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/23-saur-ops-specialist","name":"Saur Ops Specialist","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar23_3.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"9371"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-07-04T18:16:39-07:00","id":579304,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Saur Ops Specialist</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/11921-the-great-marriage-of-exalted-and-insert-fandom-here?p=579291#post579291\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> <a href=\"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=Yxrpyv8SNS4\" target=\"_blank\">Transcending history and the world, a tale of souls and swords, eternally retold...</a></div> </div> </div> </div>I was going for 'Soul Caliber' but eh, close enough","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Discord: HalfTangible#7505<br /> &quot;+3 Girlfriend is totally unoptimized. You are better off with a +1 Keen Witty girlfriend and then appling Greater Magic Make-up to increase her enhancement bonus.&quot; -Keld Danar on <a href=\"https://forums.giantitp.com/showthread.php?p=10856903#post10856903\" target=\"_blank\">GitP Forums</a><br /> Playing Peleps Raptor, Fire Aspect playboy in the Grand Tour","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/879-halftangible","name":"HalfTangible","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar879_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"366"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-07-06T20:29:01-07:00","id":581897,"title":"","content":"The war on the Blessed Isle is over. Tepet Ejava has claimed the throne, and millions lie dead to pave her way. Tired of war and mourning the loss of his legionnaire son, a former officer in her service gathers two fangs' worth of orphaned lost eggs and raises them in isolation. His goal: to prevent another civil war among the houses before it starts. After all, there are those who still believe Mnemon's claim to the throne far outweighs any young upstart. <br /> <br /> The Lost Eggs have been trained, and trained well. But when they return to the world, the Mission that has been their entire lives becomes clear: assassinate Mnemon's supporters to prevent the otherwise-inevitable uprising. They are armed, and they have the drive. But it may still not be enough--especially while the greatest among them, Inviolate Hearth, begins to doubt the cause.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/561-mockery","name":"Mockery","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar561_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"876"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-08-02T21:55:38-07:00","id":613018,"title":"","content":"In this universe, the Usurpation spanned planets and starships.<br /> In this universe, the Usurpation failed. Consumed by hedonism and political infighting, the great Shogunate was eroded by war- a brutal, century-long slaughter that both sides' leaders are too proud to end.<br /> <i>Devil's Toss,</i> an elder Dawn, is one of the many victims of this war. As his starship exploded around him, consumed in a desperate kamikaze attack, <i>Devil</i> barely made it to a functional cryopod.<br /> He drifted through enemy space for decades, unconscious of both time and the empire's shifting politics...until, by incredible chance, a Shogunate military fleet finds him. Because he is obviously not an Anathema (a judgment which has absolutely nothing to do with the fleet's lack of soldiers), their Fire Aspect captain allows him to stay onboard. Similarly, a pragmatic Chosen of Serenity decides to protect him from any 'accidents'.<br /> But there are many solar systems between the fleet and their homeland, and anything can happen...<br /> <br /> <div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Mockery</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/11921-the-great-marriage-of-exalted-and-insert-fandom-here?p=581897#post581897\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">The Lost Eggs have been trained, and trained well.</div> </div> </div> </div><i>Final Fantasy: Type 0</i>?","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/476-argonometra","name":"Argonometra","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"534"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-08-02T21:59:14-07:00","id":613022,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Argonometra</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/11921-the-great-marriage-of-exalted-and-insert-fandom-here?p=613018#post613018\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><i>Final Fantasy: Type 0</i>?</div> </div> </div> </div>Right nation of origin, wrong type of media.<br />","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/561-mockery","name":"Mockery","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar561_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"876"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-10-20T19:43:30-07:00","id":711651,"title":"","content":"A post to get this moving again:<br /> <br /> Two young Dynast twins of a minor House in the Realm are sent to a tiny satrapy in the Northeastern Threshold. There they live with their disgraced relative, who maintains his meager estate by creating fake Wonders of the First Age and displaying them to gullible mortals. Their lives change forever when one of the twins stumbles upon an ancient ruin with a dusty old tome inside. Reading over the tome, the boy learns that the tiny satrapy was built upon the ruins of a First Age city, and many of the strange wonders produced by those ancient Solar kings still exist in the forests surrounding the Satrapy. Together with his twin sister, the First Age tome, their miserly relative and his servants, the Dynast twins face all sorts of dangers, including a horde of Fair Folk seeking a new queen, the power mad Dragon-Blooded boy attempting to steal the ancient tome, numerous Sidereals drawn to the strange satrapy, a trapped prince of an undersea kingdom and a Soul of She Who Lives Within Her Name constantly manipulating behind the scenes in order to kickstart the Reclamation.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>&quot;Oh boys! Look what I got here!&quot;<br /> &quot;Hey, where the Dynast women at?&quot;","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/814-dreamking89","name":"dreamking89","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"237"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-10-21T04:37:29-07:00","id":712193,"title":"","content":"Let's see... I've got three. I'm a little new to this (and Exalted in general, though I backed 3E), so bear with me.<br /> <br /> In a small town on the coast, a mighty weather-beaten Manse sits, modeled in the image of a great warrior. Inhabited by a young Solar half-caste and the three Exalts who love him, they strive together to protect the town from the horrible Behemoths that occasionally pop up to threaten it. However, from the dark machine realm of Autochthonia, old enemies have at last turned their eyes back to Creation, and plot to finish what they started.<br /> <br /> Long ago, four incredibly powerful Exalts were united together by a secret Council to preserve the Balance of Creation. In doing so, they aided the Usurpation in slaughtering all of the raging, decadent Solars and locking their Exaltations away. Now, one of the four has been charged with sparking a war between Yu-Shan and Malfeas which has almost decimated the entire population of Creation. His brother, adamant in his belief that the warrior would never purposefully do such a thing, descends into the Underworld to speak with the Lords of Death in an attempt to prove his brother's innocence by undoing the very crime itself.<br /> <br /> Ordinarily, Yu-Shan turns a blind eye to the sinful behaviors of those who know how to hide them well enough. Unfortunately for these two God-blooded sisters, they didn't, and now they have been banished to Creation. In order to return to Yu-Shan, they must work together and use their heavenly powers to defeat demons who have escaped from Malfeas and in doing so, earn Ambrosia Coins to buy their way back in. Along the way, they are aided by a massive bear-totem Full Moon Lunar priest, a nerdy thaumaturge inventor kid, and a small, strange green First Circle demon who can only speak one word.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>There was a signature here. It's gone now.","edited":{"userid":8730,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/8730-pandorym","user":"Pandorym","date":".  Word removal. 10-21-2015, 07:44 AM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/8730-pandorym","name":"Pandorym","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar8730_2.png","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom"