ow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Ordinarily, Yu-Shan turns a blind eye to the sinful behaviors of those who know how to hide them well enough. Unfortunately for these two God-blooded sisters, they didn't, and now they have been banished to Creation. In order to return to Yu-Shan, they must work together and use their heavenly powers to defeat demons who have escaped from Malfeas and in doing so, earn Ambrosia Coins to buy their way back in. Along the way, they are aided by a massive bear-totem Full Moon Lunar priest, a nerdy thaumaturge inventor kid, and a small, strange green First Circle demon who can only speak one word.</div> </div> </div> </div>Panty and Stocking?","signature":"","edited":{"userid":476,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/476-argonometra","user":"Argonometra","date":". 10-21-2015, 08:37 AM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/476-argonometra","name":"Argonometra","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"534"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-10-21T07:14:45-07:00","id":712361,"title":"","content":"That's two of them! But who can guess my second one? Hint: it's a video game sequel.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>There was a signature here. It's gone now.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/8730-pandorym","name":"Pandorym","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar8730_2.png","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Oct 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"57"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-10-21T09:18:39-07:00","id":712566,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Pandorym</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/11921-the-great-marriage-of-exalted-and-insert-fandom-here?p=712361#post712361\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">That's two of them! But who can guess my second one? Hint: it's a video game sequel.</div> </div> </div> </div><br /> I'm pretty sure yours is Darksiders. Specifically Darksiders 2.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>&quot;Oh boys! Look what I got here!&quot;<br /> &quot;Hey, where the Dynast women at?&quot;","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/814-dreamking89","name":"dreamking89","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"237"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-10-21T12:05:13-07:00","id":712816,"title":"","content":"-After millennia, the Solar Anamathema have returned. A powerful sorceror recruits a group of recently exalted Dragon Blood to do battle against the terrible menace in mighty solar warstriders, modified by his Alchemical friend/servant/lover to work when fueled by the essence of all 5 in concert.<br /> <br /> Okay yeah that one's pretty obvious. Lemme give another shot...<br /> <br /> -A king cobra once bit a sidereal. After 5 days of long, gruelling pain and agony, the cobra died.<br /> <br /> ... wow that one's even worse. Er...<br /> <br /> Okay! A good one... albeit with maaaybe more hints than I should've given but w/e<br /> <br /> In the first age was a dawn caste woman named Radiant Saber, who was a King. She carved out a kingdom of just law and order, and was the shining example to all of exactly what a Solar should be. However, as the years went on, she became more and more distant from her people, a cold and distant king. Saber's most loyal knight and Lunar partner (Many Lances) had an affair with her wife. While Saber understood the pain that both her knight and her wife had gone through for the sake of the kingdom, the law was clear: the Queen had to be executed as a traitor. Lance could not allow this, and so Saber's kingdom fell into civil war.<br /> <br /> Saber was able to come out as the victor, but it was a pyrrhic victory: she was dying with no proper heir, and the kingdom had been shattered. She reflected on her life during her last few hours, regretting that she had been made king, and wishing to all the gods and primordials that someone better had taken her place.<br /> <br /> And to her surprise, something answered...","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Discord: HalfTangible#7505<br /> &quot;+3 Girlfriend is totally unoptimized. You are better off with a +1 Keen Witty girlfriend and then appling Greater Magic Make-up to increase her enhancement bonus.&quot; -Keld Danar on <a href=\"https://forums.giantitp.com/showthread.php?p=10856903#post10856903\" target=\"_blank\">GitP Forums</a><br /> Playing Peleps Raptor, Fire Aspect playboy in the Grand Tour","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/879-halftangible","name":"HalfTangible","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar879_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"366"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-10-21T12:13:36-07:00","id":712845,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>HalfTangible</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/11921-the-great-marriage-of-exalted-and-insert-fandom-here?p=712816#post712816\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">-After millennia, the Solar Anamathema have returned. A powerful sorceror recruits a group of recently exalted Dragon Blood to do battle against the terrible menace in mighty solar warstriders, modified by his Alchemical friend/servant/lover to work when fueled by the essence of all 5 in concert.<br /> <br /> Okay yeah that one's pretty obvious. Lemme give another shot..</div> </div> </div> </div>&quot;Finally, after thousands of years, I'm free! Time to conquer Earth!&quot;. (MMPR/Kyooryuu Sentai Zyuranger)<br /> <br /> <div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> -A king cobra once bit a sidereal. After 5 days of long, gruelling pain and agony, the cobra died.<br /> <br /> ... wow that one's even worse. Er... </div> </div> </div>Is that a Chuck Norris joke?<br /> <br /> <div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> Okay! A good one... albeit with maaaybe more hints than I should've given but w/e<br /> <br /> In the first age was a dawn caste woman named Radiant Saber, who was a King. She carved out a kingdom of just law and order, and was the shining example to all of exactly what a Solar should be. However, as the years went on, she became more and more distant from her people, a cold and distant king. Saber's most loyal knight and Lunar partner (Many Lances) had an affair with her wife. While Saber understood the pain that both her knight and her wife had gone through for the sake of the kingdom, the law was clear: the Queen had to be executed as a traitor. Lance could not allow this, and so Saber's kingdom fell into civil war.<br /> <br /> Saber was able to come out as the victor, but it was a pyrrhic victory: she was dying with no proper heir, and the kingdom had been shattered. She reflected on her life during her last few hours, regretting that she had been made king, and wishing to all the gods and primordials that someone better had taken her place.<br /> <br /> And to her surprise, something answered... </div> </div> </div>Fate/stay night","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/23-saur-ops-specialist","name":"Saur Ops Specialist","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar23_3.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"9371"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-10-29T23:19:32-07:00","id":740990,"title":"","content":"A good one I thought of.<br /> <br /> A powerful Night Caste thief has appeared out of nowhere in Creation. Some believe her to be a First Age queen who escaped the Ursurpation, while others believe her to have worked with the Sidereals for thousands of years before betraying them and leaving Yu-Shan with a variety of powerful artifacts. Whatever her true origin, the thief has numerous spirits and demons bound to her service, using them to help hersteal various wonders from all the corners of Creation. She's succeeded in stealing everything from the daiklave of Cathak Cainan himself to entire manses!<br /> <br /> Fortunately, a special Department of Fate has been assigned to recover the stolen items and capture this Solar. By recruiting the best and brightest Dragon-Blooded from the Cloister of Wisdom, the House of Bells, Pasiap's Stair and the Heptagram, the Sidereals form a temporary Wyld Hunt. This Wyld Hunt investigate the hints left behind by the rightfully cocky Solar, recover the stolen wonder and attempt to capture the thief. While the Department of Fate has succeeded in capturing a bunch of the spirits, demons and even other Exalted who help in the heists, they have yet to capture the Night Caste thief, who always manages to slip from their grasp at the last moment.<br /> <br /> (Hint: Well she sneaks across Creation, from Great Forks to Gethamane....)","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>&quot;Oh boys! Look what I got here!&quot;<br /> &quot;Hey, where the Dynast women at?&quot;","edited":{"userid":814,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/814-dreamking89","user":"dreamking89","date":". 10-30-2015, 02:28 AM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/814-dreamking89","name":"dreamking89","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"237"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-10-30T00:28:01-07:00","id":741084,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Saur Ops Specialist</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/11921-the-great-marriage-of-exalted-and-insert-fandom-here?p=712845#post712845\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> &quot;Finally, after thousands of years, I'm free! Time to conquer Earth!&quot;. (MMPR/Kyooryuu Sentai Zyuranger)<br /> <br /> <br /> <br /> Is that a Chuck Norris joke?<br /> <br /> <br /> <br /> Fate/stay night</div> </div> </div> </div>Yes, Yes but I'm not proud of it, and yes.<br /> <br /> In the first age, hundreds of enormous vaults were forged and sealed Elsewhere. The purpose of these vaults was to safeguard the most powerful relics of the Solar's might, and to keep them maintained until a day they would be needed again. However, since Solars at the time had gone coocoo for cocoa puffs, they used these refuges to conduct horrific and sometimes baffling experiments (one vault had 1 woman and 999 men while another had the opposite, for example). However, since the Solars fell, most of these vaults remained sealed for multiple generations, with only tales of the outside world to remind them such a place ever existed.<br /> <br /> However, one day, one of these vaults returned. The door opened... and you alone set out.<br /> <br /> ... This one MIGHT be changed too much from the original, i'm not sure.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Discord: HalfTangible#7505<br /> &quot;+3 Girlfriend is totally unoptimized. You are better off with a +1 Keen Witty girlfriend and then appling Greater Magic Make-up to increase her enhancement bonus.&quot; -Keld Danar on <a href=\"https://forums.giantitp.com/showthread.php?p=10856903#post10856903\" target=\"_blank\">GitP Forums</a><br /> Playing Peleps Raptor, Fire Aspect playboy in the Grand Tour","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/879-halftangible","name":"HalfTangible","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar879_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"366"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-10-30T01:20:17-07:00","id":741140,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>dreamking89</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/11921-the-great-marriage-of-exalted-and-insert-fandom-here?p=740990#post740990\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">(Hint: Well she sneaks across Creation, from Great Forks to Gethamane....)</div> </div> </div> </div>Would this lady happen to have long hair and a <a href=\"http://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Carmen_Sandiego\" target=\"_blank\">carmine coat</a>?<br /> <br /> <div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>HalfTangible</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/11921-the-great-marriage-of-exalted-and-insert-fandom-here?p=741084#post741084\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">However, one day, one of these vaults returned.</div> </div> </div> </div>One man and a box of puppets. (My sister preordered Fallout 4 only a week ago.)","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/476-argonometra","name":"Argonometra","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"534"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-10-30T07:40:36-07:00","id":741726,"title":"","content":"1. A young temple minder in training, years after his father's death, tries to save his scholar friend and monk superior on his 18th birthday when a pair of powerful ghosts attack. He believes in himself, and then dies.<br /> However, he is offered an Abyssal Exaltation by perhaps the silliest and least morbid Deathlord, but with a condition: he has 99 days to collect 15 artifacts shaped by the souls of past Exalts, and if he fails, he will die for real this time.<br /> <br /> 2. The deathlord Shrieking Eagle Leaving Creation In Shock has been building his powerbase. One young man is taken to be a mighty Dusk, but breaks free before he can be brainwashed to the Deathlord's values. This Renegade, bearing the name Rider in the Locust Mask, kicks to death a great number of Abyssal Beastmen.<br /> <br /> 3. Three Solars are taught by a group of Lunars to shape their anima, through martial arts, into warstriders. They are joined by one of the Solars' wolf Lunar brother and a brilliantly lazy Solar, but face a pair of Abyssals. The Abyssals lead an army of the undead while one of them uncovers three Deathlords to learn greater power from. All the while, a Third-Circle Soul of TED himself weaves a scheme.<br /> <br /> 4. A Chosen of Secrets schoolteacher and her sentient transforming artifact vehicle bring a class of children into contact with the many wonders of Creation, from the oceans to the human circulatory system.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/8026-beans","name":"Beans","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar8026_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Sep 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"472"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-10-30T08:02:13-07:00","id":741787,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Beans</strong> </div> <div class=\"message\">4. A Chosen of Secrets schoolteacher and her sentient transforming artifact vehicle bring a class of children into contact with the many wonders of Creation, from the oceans to the human circulatory system.</div> </div> </div> </div>Well that's the Magic School Bus. And I think 2 is Kamen Rider, though that could be wrong.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1407-endlesskng","name":"EndlessKng","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"335"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-10-30T09:51:18-07:00","id":742130,"title":"","content":"Right on both accounts. 1 and 3 are related to 2.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/8026-beans","name":"Beans","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar8026_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Sep 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"472"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-10-30T14:25:14-07:00","id":742872,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Beans</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/11921-the-great-marriage-of-exalted-and-insert-fandom-here?p=741726#post741726\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">3. Three Solars are taught by a group of Lunars to shape their anima, through martial arts, into warstriders. They are joined by one of the Solars' wolf Lunar brother and a brilliantly lazy Solar, but face a pair of Abyssals. The Abyssals lead a