 and Dragon Blooded investigators find nothing strange on the ship, save a large soulsteel box filled only with dirt. Within the next few days, the soulsteel box vanishes and the four survivors each Exalt as Abyssals, spreading a plague the likes of which are the worst the Realm has seen since the Great Contagion, causing the victims of the plague to rise after their death as zombies or hungry ghosts, each one carrying the plague as well.<br /> <br /> Meanwhile, a supposedly ancient peddler in the Imperial City hears of the 'disease' and immediately sets to work. Truly a Twilight Caste in disguise, the peddler survived and staved off the same plague in the Northeast, knowing it's source to be a Deathlord transported to the Blessed Isle in the soulsteel box aboard the ship. The Twilight caste sets off into the Imperial City, ready to destroy any of the plague carrying undead or Abyssals he encounters. Little does he know that the Deathlord has help, from a powerful wealthy Sidereal working very closely with the Deathlord's chief lieutenant: a Moonshadow Caste who the Twilight fought in the Northeast many years ago.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>&quot;Oh boys! Look what I got here!&quot;<br /> &quot;Hey, where the Dynast women at?&quot;","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/814-dreamking89","name":"dreamking89","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"237"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-12-25T21:08:06-08:00","id":792932,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>dreamking89</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-c